Dialogue: 0,2:36:51.20,2:36:53.40,Title,0,0,0,0,,《蝙蝠侠：黑暗骑士崛起》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.35,0:01:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识哈维·丹特 我是他的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew Harvey Dent. I was his friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.10,0:01:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世间恐怕很少人能够像他那样激励我们的心灵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it will be a very long time before someone inspires us the way he did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.49,0:01:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信哈维·丹特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believed in Harvey Dent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.59,0:01:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帕佛博士 我是中情局的 - 不只他一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dr. Pavel, I'm CIA. - He wasn't alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.81,0:01:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不可以带朋友来 - 他们不是我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, you don't get to bring friends. - They are not my friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.02,0:01:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我不会跟你多收钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, no charge for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.27,0:01:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我干嘛要这两个人？这两人企图绑架那个博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why would I want them? They were trying to grab your prize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.23,0:01:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是那个佣兵的手下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They work for the mercenary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.36,0:01:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,面罩怪人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The masked man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.53,0:01:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝恩？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.61,0:02:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,先带他们上飞机 我来报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get them onboard. I'll call it in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.25,0:02:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才跟局里提出登机名单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The flight plan I just filed with the agency…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.75,0:02:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有我 我的手下 帕佛博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…lists me, my men, Dr. Pavel here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.13,0:02:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们两人中只能选一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but only one of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.93,0:02:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,先招认的那个人才能留在飞机上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First one to talk gets to stay on my aircraft!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.57,0:02:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁派你们绑架帕佛博士？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who paid you to grab Dr. Pavel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.03,0:02:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该不会飞吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't fly so good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.53,0:02:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个换谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wants to try next?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.50,0:02:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我贝恩的底细{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about Bane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.29,0:02:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么戴着面罩？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does he wear the mask?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.59,0:02:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也未免太忠心耿耿了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of loyalty for a hired gun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.13,0:02:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能在纳闷 为什么把人丢下飞机之前…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, perhaps he's wondering why someone would shoot a man…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.97,0:03:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要先开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…before throwing him out of a plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.06,0:03:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少你会说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least you can talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.93,0:03:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是什么人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.23,0:03:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是谁并不重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter who we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.15,0:03:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,重要的是我们的计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What matters is our plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.65,0:03:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前我没戴面罩的时候 没人在意我是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one cared who I was till I put on the mask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.66,0:03:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 扯掉面具你会死吗？ - 会非常痛苦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If I pull that off, will you die? - It would be extremely painful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.29,0:03:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你挺壮的 - 对你而言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're a big guy. - For you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.63,0:03:39.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,被逮捕也是你们计划的一部分吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was getting caught part of your plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.17,0:03:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.51,0:03:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕佛博士拒绝为我们做事 转而投靠你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Pavel refused our offer in favor of yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.18,0:03:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得查明他是否有泄漏机密 - 没有！我什么也没说！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We had to find out what he told you… - Nothing. I said nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.08,0:04:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你！现在你被抓了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, congratulations, you got yourself caught!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.79,0:04:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官 - 下一步计划是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir? - Now what's the next step of your master plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.08,0:04:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸掉这架飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crashing this plane…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.13,0:04:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不留活口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with no survivors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.99,0:04:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫！呼叫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mayday, Mayday!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.29,0:05:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要对我做什么？放开我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! What you doing to me? Let me out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.50,0:05:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.38,0:05:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.85,0:05:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能走 我们其中一人的尸体必须留在飞机残骸里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! They expect one of us in the wreckage, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.73,0:06:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开战了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have we started the fire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.44,0:06:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 战火要升起了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, the fire rises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.87,0:06:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点 博士 现在还不到恐惧的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down, doctor. Now is not the time for fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.17,0:06:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好戏还在后头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That comes later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.49,0:06:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈维·丹特纪念日虽然不是传统节日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harvey Dent Day may not be our oldest public holiday…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.41,0:06:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,却是最重要的节日之一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but we're here tonight because it's one of the most important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.62,0:06:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈维·丹特不遗余力地对抗组织性犯罪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harvey Dent's uncompromising stand against organized crime…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.91,0:07:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,使得高谭市在这八年间治安逐渐进步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…had made Gotham a safer place than it was at the time of his death, eight years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.21,0:07:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个城市造就了历史性的转变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This city has seen a historic turnaround.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.59,0:07:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个城市都有犯罪 但高谭市没有组织性犯罪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No city is without crime, but this city is without organized crime because the Dent Act…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.05,0:07:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,归功于丹特法案提供的有效利器让我们能对抗犯罪集团{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…gave law enforcement teeth in its fight against the mob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.43,0:07:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有些人主张废除丹特法案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now people are talking about repealing the Dent Act…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.27,0:07:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在此我承诺：「决不让此事发生」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and to them I say, "Not on my watch."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.77,0:07:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢韦恩基金会举办这场晚会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to thank the Wayne Foundation for hosting this event.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.69,0:07:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然韦恩先生今晚不能出席 但他的精神与我们同在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm told Mr. Wayne couldn't be here tonight. I'm sure he's with us in spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.99,0:07:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我要把麦克风交给一位重量级的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I'm gonna give way to an important voice…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.91,0:07:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近有人见过韦恩先生吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever lay eyes on Wayne at one of these things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.53,0:07:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 很多年都没人看见他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one has. Not in years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.41,0:07:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们曾对一位头戴面具 身穿披风的凶手寄予信任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…people put their faith in a murderous thug in a mask and a cape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.46,0:07:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他最终露出了他的真面目{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thug who showed his true nature…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.17,0:07:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不但背叛了这位英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when he betrayed the trust of this great man…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.71,0:07:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还冷血地将他杀害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and murdered him in cold blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.01,0:07:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,小美人 别走那么快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetheart, not so fast with the chow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.55,0:07:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要来点虾球吗？ - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shrimp balls? - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.72,0:07:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆·高登将会跟大家介绍哈维·丹特的真实故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim Gordon can tell you the truth about Harvey Dent. {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.56,0:08:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在欢迎他上台 高登局长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll let him tell you himself. Commissioner Gordon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.15,0:08:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,真实故事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.49,0:08:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备了一份讲稿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have written a speech…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.96,0:08:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是关于哈维·丹特的真实故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…telling the truth about Harvey Dent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.71,0:08:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许现在不是适当的时机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the time isn't right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.68,0:08:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe right now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.43,0:08:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家只需要知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…all you need to know is that there are…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.73,0:08:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑门监狱里关了上千名囚犯 这都是归功于丹特法案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…1000 inmates in Blackgate Prison as a direct result of the Dent Act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.19,0:08:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是残暴的歹徒 是集团犯罪份子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are violent criminals, essential cogs in the organized-crime machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.32,0:08:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能说 哈维·丹特…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe, for now, all I should say about the death of Harvey Dent is this:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.49,0:09:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有白白牺牲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has not been for nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有看过这家的主人吗？ - 没有 我听说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You see the guy who owns the house? - No. I heard…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.88,0:09:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他从没踏出东宫一步 - 我听说他出了点意外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …he never leaves the east wing. - I heard he had an accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.00,0:09:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 好像毁容了… - 提尔先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, that he's disfigured. He has to wear a… - Mr. Till?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.05,0:09:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的人怎么可以使用大厅楼梯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are your people using the main staircase?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.22,0:09:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,波顿太太在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where's Mrs. Bolton?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.01,0:09:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在吧台 有什么需要帮忙的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, she's at the bar, sir. Can I help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.18,0:09:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去东宫的房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The east drawing room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.56,0:09:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,把门打开 将餐盘放在桌上 然后再把门锁上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unlock the door, put the tray on the table, lock the door again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.67,0:09:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他什么都别做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.61,0:09:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 泰特小姐 我通报了 但他不想见你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Miss Tate. I tried, but he won't see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.36,0:09:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道 他并不是针对你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you mustn't take it personally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.49,0:09:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都说韦恩先生成天窝在屋里 指甲长到8寸长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone knows that Wayne's holed up in there with 8-inch nails peeing into Mason jars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.33,0:09:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是非常感谢你们让我惨赔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very good of you to let me on the grounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.05,0:10:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你何必浪费时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you wasting your time trying to talk to a man…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.56,0:10:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只会把你投入的拯救世界计划丢在一旁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who threw away your investment on some save-the-world vanity project?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.44,0:10:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不能让你的投资回本 但我可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't get your money back. I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.48,0:10:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以花时间给你解释拯救世界的企划案 赚不赚钱…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could try explaining that a save-the-world project, vain or not…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.03,0:10:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,…都是值得投资的 达格先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is worth investing in, Mr. Daggett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.61,0:10:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,像你这种人 眼里只有金钱和权力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you understand only money and the power you think it buys…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.99,0:10:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,何必来浪费我的时间？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so why waste my time indeed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.45,0:10:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿到第二次人事调动报告了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second shift reports in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.12,0:10:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该跟市长混熟一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should spend more time with the mayor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.37,0:10:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的专长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's your department.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.25,0:10:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看过犯罪统计报告书了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone shown him the crime stats?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.21,0:10:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是凭着冲劲在办案的 不管统计数字是多少{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He goes by his gut and it bothers him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.04,0:10:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他永远不会满意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter what the numbers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.67,0:10:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那她老婆一定很爱他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be popular with his wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.14,0:10:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 她带着孩子移居到了克里夫兰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really. She took the kids to Cleveland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.72,0:10:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很快就会有时间去探望妻小了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll have plenty of time for visits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.59,0:10:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,市长明年春季要开除他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mayor's gonna dump him in the spring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.10,0:10:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗？ - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Mm-hm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.81,0:10:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可是他是英雄 - 他是战争英雄 但现在是和平时代{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But he's a hero. - A war hero. This is peacetime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.84,0:11:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 先生 真的很抱歉 韦恩先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry, sorry. I'm so terribly sorry, Mr. Wayne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.68,0:11:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,您是韦恩先生 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is Mr. Wayne, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.10,0:11:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过您并没有很长的指甲 也没有满脸疤痕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although you don't have the long nails or, heh, the facial scars, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.07,0:11:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家传说我长那样吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what they say about me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.57,0:11:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为从来没人见过您{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that no one ever sees you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.95,0:11:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的项链真美 让我想起我母亲的项链{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a beautiful necklace. Reminds me of one that belonged to my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.99,0:11:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会是同一条吧…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be the same one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.58,0:11:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的项链一直锁在保险箱里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…because her pearls are in this safe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.04,0:12:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,厂商说这款保险箱是无法破解的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the manufacturer clearly explained is uncrackable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.89,0:12:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.77,0:12:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人告诉我那保险箱是无法破解的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody told me it was uncrackable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.69,0:12:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恐怕不能让你带走那项链{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I can't let you take those.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.77,0:12:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 你不会打女人 而我也不会打残障人士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you wouldn't beat up a woman any more than I would beat up a cripple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.82,0:12:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 凡事总有例外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, sometimes exceptions have to be made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.70,0:12:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 韦恩先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, Mr. Wayne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.68,0:12:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以搭个便车吗？ - 正合我意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I have a ride? - You read my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.52,0:12:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.06,0:12:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰特小姐又来见您{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Tate was asking to see you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.02,0:12:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真固执…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's very persistent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.81,0:13:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且长得很漂亮 您可能想知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And quite lovely, in case you were wondering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.32,0:13:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不想 - 您在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wasn't. - What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.65,0:13:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在检查采指纹的粉末 我们家遭小偷了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Examining print dust. We've been robbed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.11,0:13:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,您不是说要装警铃？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is your idea of, uh, sounding the alarm, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.24,0:13:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她偷走的珍珠项链里面有追踪器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took the pearls, tracking device and all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.58,0:13:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁？ - 一个女仆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She? - One of the maids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.04,0:13:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该禁止她们进出这个房间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you should stop letting them in this side of the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.83,0:13:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那您可能要学习自己整理床铺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you should start learning to make your own bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.54,0:13:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 您为什么要采指纹？ - 不是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why were you dusting for prints? - I wasn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.26,0:13:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她采的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.01,0:13:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 基利议员的夫人来电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir. Congressman Gilly's wife has been calling in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.22,0:13:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说议员在晚会结束后一直没回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The congressman never made it home after the Wayne Foundation event.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.77,0:13:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是警察的工作？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a job for the police?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.60,0:13:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,您和丹特先生的扫黑行动做得太成功{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you and Dent cleaned the streets, you cleaned them good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.61,0:13:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以后只能去帮图书馆追讨逾期书籍了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty soon we'll be chasing down, uh, overdue library books.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.15,0:13:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 您仍像从前那样坚守岗位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet here you are, like we're still at war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.29,0:13:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么名字？ - 我叫布莱克 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's your name, son? - Blake, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.70,0:13:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有其他问题要问吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have something you want to ask me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.75,0:14:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,八年前 丹特遇害的那个晚上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about that night. This night, eight years ago. The night Dent died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.25,0:14:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一次看到蝙蝠侠现身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last confirmed sighting of the Batman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.67,0:14:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀了人 击退两支特种部队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He murders those people, takes down two SWAT teams…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.63,0:14:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,打断丹特的脖子 然后消失得无影无踪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…breaks Dent's neck and then just vanishes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.85,0:14:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没听懂你的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not hearing a question, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.35,0:14:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,您不想知道他的真实身份吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you want to know who he was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.19,0:14:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很清楚他是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know exactly who he was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.77,0:14:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是蝙蝠侠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was the Batman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.78,0:14:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去找议员夫人吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go see about the congressman's wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.37,0:14:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦恩少爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Wayne?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.63,0:14:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦恩少爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Wayne?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.45,0:15:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,您很久没下来这儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't been down here in a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.99,0:15:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想查出那个珠宝大盗的底细 我比对了指纹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to find out more about our jewel thief. I ran her prints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.79,0:15:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非她最近减肥成功{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless she's lost a lot of weight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.79,0:15:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则一定是冒用了别人的指纹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…she was wearing someone else's fingerprints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.30,0:15:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,她颇有本事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.59,0:15:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧 但我们项链上装有追踪器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She may be, but we have a trace on the necklace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.30,0:15:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我把她返回的地址{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do. I cross-referenced the address she went back to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.09,0:15:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,和警方的犯罪数据库相比对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with police data on high-end B-and-E's, and, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.18,0:15:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了瑟琳娜·凯尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Selina Kyle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.10,0:15:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的数据显示她屡次侥幸脱逃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The databases are full of close-calls, tips from fences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.11,0:15:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有两把刷子 但是她已经快要走投无路了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's good, but the ground is shrinking beneath her feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.28,0:15:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最好赶快通知警方 免得她把项链卖掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should send the police before she fences the pearls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.20,0:15:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会卖 她太喜欢那项链了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She won't. She likes them too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.57,0:15:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且那不是她原本要偷的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they weren't what she was after.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.53,0:15:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她要偷什么？ - 我的指纹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was she after? - My fingerprints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.79,0:16:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她用的是打印机碳粉和石磨的混合粉末{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was printer toner mixed with graphite on the safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.96,0:16:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,容易取指纹 又不会被追踪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gives a good pull and it's untraceable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.71,0:16:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,太厉害了！你们两个应该一起喝杯咖啡交换心得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fascinating. You two should exchange notes over coffee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.71,0:16:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是要把我和珠宝大盗凑成一对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're trying to set me up with a jewel thief?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.17,0:16:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了把你拉回现实世界 我还不惜搓合你和黑猩猩呢！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At this point, I'd set you up with a chimpanzee, if it brought you back to the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.80,0:16:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面没有什么值得我留恋的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing out there for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.30,0:16:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是问题所在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's the problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.97,0:16:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你卸下了披风和面具 但你的人生没有继续下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hung up your cape and your cowl but you didn't move on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.68,0:16:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有认真生活 找个伴侣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never went to find a life. To find someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.14,0:16:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿福…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alfred…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.52,0:16:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经找到了伴侣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I did find someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但你失去她了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, and you lost them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.07,0:16:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,人生难免会这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's all part of living, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.19,0:16:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你没有继续你的人生 你只是空等 期待情势再度恶化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not living, you're just waiting, hoping for things to go bad again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.53,0:16:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得你离开高谭市的时候吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember when you left Gotham?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.16,0:16:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你成为蝙蝠侠之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before all this, before Batman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.91,0:16:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你离开了七年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were gone seven years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.12,0:16:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那七年间我一直等 希望你不要回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven years I waited, hoping that you wouldn't come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.88,0:16:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,每年我度假的时候 都会去佛罗伦萨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every year, I took a holiday. I went to Florence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.67,0:16:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚诺河畔的一间咖啡店{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's this cafe on the banks of the Arno.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.09,0:16:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天傍晚我都坐在那里 点一杯苦酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every fine evening I'd sit there and order a Fernet Branca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.18,0:17:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,幻想着…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had this fantasy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.52,0:17:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不经意的一瞥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that I would look across the tables…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.85,0:17:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见你坐在别桌 带着老婆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I'd see you there, with a wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.52,0:17:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能还有几个孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe a couple of kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.40,0:17:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我之间没有任何言语交谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't say anything to me, nor me to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.57,0:17:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们都明白 你过得很好 很快乐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we'd both know that you'd made it. That you were happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.67,0:17:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从不希望你回来高谭市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never wanted you to come back to Gotham.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.55,0:17:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很清楚这里没有属于你的东西 只有伤痛和苦难{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always knew there was nothing here for you, except pain and tragedy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.22,0:17:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望你过这样的日子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wanted something more for you than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.10,0:17:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在仍这么想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.69,0:17:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每个月都来这边刷洗好几次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wash up here a couple of times a month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.69,0:17:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,天气冷的时候还更频繁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More when it gets colder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.32,0:17:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多游民住在下水道里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Homeless, sheltering in the tunnels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.95,0:18:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是把他从下面拉上来 没碰别的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We pulled him from the basin, but other than that we didn't touch him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.45,0:18:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 他是吉米{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Name's Jimmy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.25,0:18:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,住在圣史文森孤儿院{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's from St. Swithin's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.29,0:18:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我球队里的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the boys' home where I coach some ball.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.01,0:18:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米好几个月没出现了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jimmy hadn't been around for months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.88,0:18:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？ - 布莱克 你应该很清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No? Why? - Blake, you know why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.55,0:18:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他年纪超过16岁了 我们没有经费来负担超过16岁的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He aged out. We don't have the resources to keep boys on after 16.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.56,0:18:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦恩基金会不是有提供资金吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the Wayne Foundation gave money for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.81,0:18:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近这几年已经没有了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for the past couple of years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.06,0:18:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他有个弟弟 对吧？ - 叫做马克 我会通知他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He has a brother here, doesn't he? - Mark. I'll tell him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.06,0:18:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来 如果你不介意的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to, if that's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.19,0:18:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你哥哥在下水道里做什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what he was doing in the tunnels?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.45,0:18:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多男孩子超过年龄后就会去下水道里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lot of guys been going down the tunnels when they age out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说可以住在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say you can live down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.33,0:18:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面有工作可以做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say there's work down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.04,0:18:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.83,0:18:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,下水道里可以找到什么样的工作？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of work are you gonna find in the sewers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.67,0:18:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想比地面上可以找到的还多吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than you can find up here, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.17,0:18:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道蝙蝠侠？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you know about him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.59,0:18:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.55,0:19:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他会回来吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think he's coming back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.56,0:19:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.57,0:19:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还带人来约会？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought a date?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.41,0:19:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢有人帮我开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like having someone around to open doors for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.91,0:19:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,右手的 不是很完整{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right hand. No partials.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.67,0:19:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.96,0:19:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,别急 帅哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so fast, handsome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.30,0:19:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要的东西带来没？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got something for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.13,0:19:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.19,0:19:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你要韦恩先生的指纹做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're planning to do with Mr. Wayne's prints…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.48,0:19:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我猜你应该需要用到拇指{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I'm guessing you'll need his thumb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.07,0:20:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像没数清楚啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't count so good, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.32,0:20:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我数得很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I count fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.99,0:20:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我现在要开始数到十{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I'm counting to 10 right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.79,0:20:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我朋友在外面 只要按发送键就好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend's outside. Just hit "send."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.22,0:20:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方好暗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is a little dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.72,0:20:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下就会很亮 不骗你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll liven up in a minute. Trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.56,0:20:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everything okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.86,0:20:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好 待会儿见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Catch you later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.53,0:20:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你答应我的东西交出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would have been a lot easier…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.33,0:20:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不会弄得这么复杂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to just give me what we agreed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.45,0:20:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不想走漏消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't have loose ends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.08,0:20:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜你打扮得再美 也不会有人记得你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even in that dress, no one's gonna miss you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.00,0:20:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.67,0:21:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有看到我那个朋友吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my friend over there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.71,0:21:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,城里所有的警察都在找他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every cop in the city's missing him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.05,0:21:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.55,0:21:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过警察不会找到这种地方来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're not gonna be looking in a place like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.60,0:21:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很难说 你刚才用了他的手机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. You did just use his cell phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.57,0:21:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快 - 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go! - Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.25,0:21:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是警察 趴下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police! Get down now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.21,0:21:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！救命啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.51,0:21:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊！救命啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me, please! Please help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.02,0:22:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,把伤口压紧 甜心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep some pressure on that, sweetheart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.94,0:22:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,打电话给我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.07,0:22:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小姐 你没事吧？ - 有人流血了！那边！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay, miss? - He's bleeding. You gotta help him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.62,0:22:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到议员了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the congressman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.65,0:22:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.07,0:22:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个入口 打开它 通知水电公司{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manhole! Get this up! Get the DWP down here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.99,0:22:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们三个 跟我一起下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You three, down with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.70,0:23:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个 去下个出口掩护{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two, you go down, cover the next exit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.81,0:23:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,高登下去了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, they went down there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.59,0:23:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们应该要下去看看吧？ - 那是瓦斯气爆 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're gonna go down there, right? - That was a gas explosion, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.93,0:23:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瓦斯？这明明是下水道 - 还没弄清楚之前 谁都不准下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wasn't gas. It's a sewer. - No one goes in till we know what's there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.35,0:23:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是警察局长在下面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know, sir. The police commissioner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.35,0:24:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来把这个热血青年带走？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone get this hothead out of here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.35,0:24:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,水电公司的人怎么还不来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where's that DWP guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.48,0:24:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们来这里做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.23,0:24:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回答{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.44,0:24:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是问你们两个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was asking you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.74,0:24:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是警察局长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the police commissioner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.08,0:25:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们把他带下来这里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you brought him down here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.21,0:25:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不知道要怎么处理 - 你们惊慌失措{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We didn't know what to do. - You panicked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.33,0:25:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的懦弱造成其他三人死亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your weakness has cost the lives of three others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.46,0:25:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他孤身一人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.47,0:25:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜他身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Search him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.18,0:25:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我再杀了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I will kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.25,0:25:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他死了 - 尸体在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's dead. - So show me his body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.34,0:25:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道流向哪个出水口 我们找不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The water runs to any one of the outflows. We'd never find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.80,0:26:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就跟踪他 - 跟踪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Follow him! - Follow him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.74,0:26:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,局长 局长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay? You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.70,0:26:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, you awake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.25,0:26:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要见布鲁斯·韦恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to see Bruce Wayne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.04,0:26:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 韦恩先生不接待未预约的客人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Mr. Wayne doesn't take unscheduled calls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.67,0:26:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是警察也不例外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even from a police officer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.63,0:26:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我去申请搜索票 来调查哈维·丹特的谋杀案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I go get a warrant for the investigation of Harvey Dent's murder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.47,0:26:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样也需要预约吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That still count as unscheduled?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.85,0:26:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,找我有什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do for you, officer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.23,0:26:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,高登局长中枪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commissioner Gordon's been shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.65,0:26:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他到下水道追缉嫌犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He chased a gunman down into the sewers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.86,0:26:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救他上来的时候 他含糊地提到一个地下军团{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I pulled him out, he was babbling about an underground army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.36,0:26:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个面罩怪人 名叫贝恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A masked man called Bane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.03,0:27:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是应该去向上级报告这件事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't you be telling your superior officers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.53,0:27:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只问他有没有看到巨型的鳄鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They asked me if he saw any giant alligators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.08,0:27:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.37,0:27:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他需要蝙蝠侠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs the Batman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.42,0:27:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 高登局长认为… - 他不知道也不想知道你是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If Commissioner Gordon thinks… - Oh, he doesn't know or care who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.01,0:27:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前见过你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we've met before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.09,0:27:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前我还是个孩子的时候 在圣史文森孤儿院…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a long time ago. I was a kid. Uh, St. Swithin's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.89,0:27:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦恩基金会以前赞助过的孤儿院{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It used to be funded by the Wayne Foundation. It's an orphanage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.56,0:27:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈在我很小的时候出车祸去世了 我对这件事没什么记忆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom died when I was small. It was a car accident, I don't really remember it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.31,0:27:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,几年后我爸被枪杀 因为积欠赌债{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my dad got shot a couple years later over a gambling debt…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.74,0:27:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我就记得很清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I remember that one just fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.32,0:27:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,很少人能了解我的感受{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a lot of people know what it feels like, do they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.62,0:27:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种刻骨铭心的愤怒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be angry in your bones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.50,0:28:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,养父母都会说他们可以理解 但那只是很短暂的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, they understand. Foster parents. Everybody understands for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.39,0:28:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他们就开始要求这个愤怒的孩子去做他做不到的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then they want the angry little kid to do something he knows he can't do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.68,0:28:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,「继续生活下去」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.35,0:28:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以过一阵子他们就不再体谅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So after a while, they stop understanding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.48,0:28:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把这个愤怒的孩子送到孤儿院去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They send the angry kid to a boys' home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.73,0:28:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太晚看透这件事 原来我必须学习隐藏愤怒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured it out too late. You gotta learn to hide the anger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.23,0:28:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对着镜子练习微笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Practice smiling in a mirror.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.40,0:28:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像戴上面具一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like putting on a mask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.16,0:28:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天 你开着名车 揽着美女出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you showed up this one day, in a cool car. Pretty girl on your arm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.79,0:28:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都很兴奋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were so excited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.87,0:28:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯·韦恩 亿万身价的孤儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce Wayne, billionaire orphan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.92,0:28:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们常常编造关于你的传奇故事…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we used to make up stories about you, man. Legends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.84,0:28:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,对别的孩子而言 那只是单纯的故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, you know, with the other kids, that's all it was, just stories, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.26,0:28:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我第一次看到你 就知道你的真实身份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right when I saw you, I knew who you really were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.97,0:28:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前就看过你脸上的那种神情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd seen that look on your face before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.81,0:28:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我自己练习的表情一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the same one I taught myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.90,0:29:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你为何要扛下谋杀丹特的罪名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why you took the fall for Dent's murder…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.65,0:29:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我仍然深信蝙蝠侠 就算你不是他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I'm still a believer in the Batman even if you're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.91,0:29:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么说韦恩基金会「以前赞助过」你们孤儿院？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you say that your boys' home used to be funded by the Wayne Foundation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.00,0:29:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为赞助金已经终止了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the money stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.92,0:29:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去呼吸新鲜空气 开始搜查案情了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might be time to get some fresh air. Start paying attention to the details.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.00,0:29:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些地方可能会需要你的帮助{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of those details might need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.18,0:29:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你调查过贝恩那个人了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You check that name? Bane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.68,0:29:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个雇佣兵 姓名不详{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a mercenary. No other known names.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.51,0:29:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们曾经在西非发动了一场政变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him and his men were behind a coup in West Africa…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.14,0:29:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在帮约翰·达格先生的采矿公司执行保安工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that secured mining operations for our friend John Daggett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.35,0:29:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以是达格先生把他带来的 - 看来是如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now Daggett's brought them here. - Or so it seems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.23,0:29:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会继续调查 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll keep digging. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.57,0:29:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿福 为什么韦恩基金会终止赞助孤儿院？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alfred, why did the Wayne Foundation stop funding boys' homes in the city?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.95,0:29:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,基金会的资金来自韦恩企业的利润{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The foundation is funded by the profits of Wayne Enterprises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.37,0:29:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是有的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There have to be some.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.08,0:30:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 应该跟福克斯先生聊聊 - 我来打电话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Time to talk to Mr. Fox, I think. - I'll get him on the phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.59,0:30:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 我们还有车可以用吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Do we still have any cars around the place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.76,0:30:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一两台{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. One or two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.80,0:30:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我预约医院 我想治疗我的腿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need an appointment at the hospital for my leg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.97,0:30:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪间医院？ - 吉姆·高登住的那间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which hospital? - Whichever one Jim Gordon's in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.10,0:30:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我看过更糟的软骨状况 - 那是好事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have seen worse cartilage in knees. - That's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.06,0:30:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 你的膝关节里已经没有软骨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. That's because there is no cartilage in your knee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.73,0:30:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,肘关节和肩关节里也所剩不多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not much of any use in your elbows or your shoulders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.24,0:30:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,加上肾脏的疤痕组织{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between that and the scar tissue on your kidneys…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.78,0:30:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑组织里残留的脑震荡伤害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the residual concussive damage to your brain tissue…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.62,0:30:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有满是伤痕的身体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the general scarred-over quality of your body…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.45,0:30:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我真的不建议你从事直升机滑雪 - 我了解了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I cannot recommend that you go heli-skiing. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.85,0:30:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们曾经并肩作战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were in this together…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.48,0:31:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却离我们而去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then you were gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.19,0:31:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们不再需要蝙蝠侠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Batman wasn't needed anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.48,0:31:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们已经胜利了 - 那只是个谎言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We won. - Based on a lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.07,0:31:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在恶势力再度崛起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now there's evil rising from where we tried to bury it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.32,0:31:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,蝙蝠侠必须回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Batman has to come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.95,0:31:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他已经不存在了呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if he doesn't exist anymore?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.58,0:31:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要回来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.77,0:31:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我的皮夹偷走了 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took my goddamn wallet, didn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.77,0:31:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你把我的皮夹偷走了 - 没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You f… You took my wallet! - No, I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.35,0:31:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 滚出去 - 她偷我的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out. - She took my… Ah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.73,0:31:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快滚 - 变态{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now. - Creep!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.48,0:31:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他干嘛那么生气 里面才60块而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what he's so upset about. There's only 60 bucks in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.57,0:31:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一支手表{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably the watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.59,0:32:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那位是谁？ - 连爬出跑车都有困难的老头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's that? - A stiff can barely climb out of his sports car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.09,0:32:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是布鲁斯·韦恩 - 韦恩先生 请看这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, that's Bruce Wayne! - Mr. Wayne, over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.27,0:32:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我助理不知有没有… - 这边请 韦恩先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not sure if my assistant… - Right through here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.81,0:32:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.57,0:32:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯·韦恩现身慈善晚会？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce Wayne at a charity ball.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.40,0:32:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰特小姐吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Tate, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.28,0:32:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,您在退隐之前也从未出席过这种场合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even before you became a recluse, you never came to these things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.79,0:32:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实收入都用来支付举办晚宴的费用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The proceeds go to the big fat spread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.73,0:32:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也说不上是慈善晚会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about charity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.33,0:32:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是用来满足主办人的虚荣而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about feeding the ego of whichever society hag laid this on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.17,0:32:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实这场晚会是我办的 韦恩先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, this is my party, Mr. Wayne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.80,0:32:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚宴的费用都由我个人负担 收入会全数捐出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the proceeds will go where they should, because I paid for the big fat spread myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.35,0:32:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,您非常慷慨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's very generous of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.97,0:33:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,总得做一些投资才能帮社会解决贫富不均的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to invest if you want to restore balance to the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.98,0:33:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我们的干净能源计划一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take our clean-energy project.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.27,0:33:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候投资未必能成功{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes the investment doesn't pay off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.69,0:33:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很遗憾 - 你的冷漠是装出来的 韦恩先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - You have a practiced apathy, Mr. Wayne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.53,0:33:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个对社会漠不关心的人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a man who doesn't care about the world…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.48,0:33:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能会投入半数财产来拯救这个世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't spend half his fortune to save it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.66,0:33:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不会因计划失败而感到如此失落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And isn't so wounded when it fails…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.08,0:33:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,失落到隐世不出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that he goes into hiding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.17,0:33:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝您有个愉快的夜晚 韦恩先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a good evening, Mr. Wayne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.30,0:33:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以把舞伴借给我吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind if I cut in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.05,0:33:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.76,0:33:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看到我好像不怎么开心 - 你不是应该宅在家里吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't seem happy to see me. - You were supposed to be a shut-in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.10,0:33:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想呼吸点新鲜空气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt like some fresh air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.77,0:33:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么没报警？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you call the police?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.23,0:33:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个厉害的朋友专门处理这类问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a powerful friend who deals with things like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.07,0:33:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这身服装真亮眼 是扮黑猫女贼吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a brazen costume for a cat burglar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.90,0:33:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？你又是在扮谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Who are you pretending to be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.66,0:34:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯·韦恩 亿万身价的怪人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce Wayne, eccentric billionaire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.45,0:34:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的男伴是什么人？ - 他老婆在「伊碧莎」岛度假{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's your date? - His wife's in Ibiza.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.62,0:34:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把钻石锁在家里 担心被偷走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She left her diamonds behind, though. Worried they might get stolen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.58,0:34:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是「艾碧莎」岛才对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pronounced "Ibiza."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.21,0:34:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不怕被发现你其实是个贼 而不是什么社交名媛吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't want these folks realizing you're a crook, not a social climber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.05,0:34:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我会在乎那些人是怎么看待我的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I care what anyone in this room thinks of me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.84,0:34:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你根本不在乎任何人对你的看法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt you care what anyone in any room thinks of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.35,0:34:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要附和我 韦恩先生 你对我一无所知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't condescend, Mr. Wayne. You don't know a thing about me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.68,0:34:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是瑟琳娜·凯尔 你今天晚上从旧城区过来这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Selina Kyle, I know you came here from your walk-up in Old Town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.06,0:34:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对一个珠宝大盗而言 那住所也未免太寒酸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A modest place for a master jewel thief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.07,0:34:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着 你不是在存退休金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means that either you're saving for retirement…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.99,0:34:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是招惹错人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or you're in deep with the wrong people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.41,0:34:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么资格评论我？就凭你出生于韦恩豪宅的主卧室吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't get to judge me because you were born in the master bedroom of Wayne Manor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.54,0:34:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 其实我是在摄政厅出生的 - 刚开始我也是逼不得已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Actually, I was born in the Regency Room. - I started out doing what I had to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.04,0:34:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事一旦开始之后 就回不去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you've done what you had to, they never let you do what you want to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.59,0:34:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以重新开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start fresh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.00,0:34:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,现今的世界早就没有「重新开始」这种事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh. There's no fresh start in today's world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.38,0:35:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便一个12岁的小孩都可以用手机查到你的背景{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any 12-year-old with a cell phone could find out what you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.59,0:35:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做过的每件事都会被检验 被量化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything we do is collated and quantified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.93,0:35:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,每件事都会被贴上标签{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything sticks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.57,0:35:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就把窃盗行为正当化？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that how you justify stealing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.14,0:35:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只会从有钱人的身上偷取我所需要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take what I need from those who have more than enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.90,0:35:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从不偷穷人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't stand on the shoulders of people with less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.36,0:35:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你是罗宾汉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robin Hood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.57,0:35:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信我做过的善事比在场的每一个人都多 也比你多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'd do more to help someone than most of the people in this room. Than you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.65,0:35:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得你话说得太满？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think maybe you're assuming a little too much?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.91,0:35:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你才是不切实际 以为你钱包比较大就很屌吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're being unrealistic about what's really in your pants other than your wallet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.12,0:35:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,话真呛人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ouch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.66,0:35:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为这种好景还能持续多久？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think all this can last?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.55,0:35:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一场风暴即将来袭 韦恩先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a storm coming, Mr. Wayne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.38,0:35:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你的朋友最好准备应战 因为当风暴来袭的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your friends better batten down the hatches, because when it hits…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.76,0:35:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都将感叹 居然自以为能享尽荣华富贵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you're all gonna wonder how you ever thought you could live so large…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.80,0:35:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们其余的人受苦受难{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and leave so little for the rest of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.18,0:35:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你很期待{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound like you're looking forward to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.10,0:35:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很能适应环境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm adaptable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.86,0:35:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这珍珠项链戴在你身上比放在保险箱里美多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those pearls do look better on you than they did in my safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.86,0:36:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我还是不能送给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I still can't let you keep them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.74,0:36:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把她吓跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You… You scared her off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.83,0:36:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not likely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.50,0:36:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找不到我的停车券{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have lost my ticket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.05,0:36:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 您的夫人要您搭出租车回去 - 我夫人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your wife said you were taking a cab home. - My wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.85,0:36:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有您一个人吗 少爷？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just you, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.35,0:36:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 韦恩少爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, Master Wayne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.11,0:36:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,重出江湖是需要一点时间的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Takes a little time to get back in the swing of things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.32,0:36:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯·韦恩 真是稀客啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce Wayne, as I live and breathe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.37,0:36:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你结束冬眠了吗 韦恩先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What brings you out of cryo-sleep, Mr. Wayne?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.91,0:36:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你的幽默感一点都没有减{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't lost your sense of humor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.83,0:36:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你却让我损失了很多钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if you have lost most of my money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.50,0:36:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 那是你造成的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, you did that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.17,0:36:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你把所有研发经费都投注在核融合计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you funnel your entire R and D budget…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.04,0:37:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后又把它整个停掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…into a fusion project that you then mothball…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.13,0:37:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的公司恐怕很难赚钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…your company is unlikely to thrive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.63,0:37:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么解决方案吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are my options?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.84,0:37:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不愿意启动那台机器…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you're unwilling to turn on the machine…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.10,0:37:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能那样做 卢修斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. I can't, Lucius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.51,0:37:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么就只能耐心等候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then sit tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.23,0:37:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的多数席次让达格先生无法轻举妄动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majority keeps Daggett at bay…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.10,0:37:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以和米兰达·泰特小姐一起共商能源计划的未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…while we figure out a future for the energy program with Miranda Tate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.27,0:37:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她自始自终都非常支持这个计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has supported the project all the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.32,0:37:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个聪明人 而且很漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's smart. And quite lovely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.49,0:37:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是为你着想 布鲁斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all just want what's best for you, Bruce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.28,0:37:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她看看那台机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show her the machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.95,0:37:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会考虑看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll think it over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.41,0:37:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他问题吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.91,0:37:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了 怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.33,0:37:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常你来找我都会有一些特殊的需求{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These conversations used to end with an unusual request.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.13,0:37:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经退休了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I retired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.84,0:37:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然来了就顺便看样东西吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hm. Well, let me show you some stuff anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.06,0:37:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是重温旧梦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just for old times' sake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.02,0:38:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为这里早就关闭了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured you'd have shut this place down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.23,0:38:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对外是宣称关闭了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it was always shut down, officially.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.07,0:38:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么新东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this new stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.32,0:38:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲过世后 韦恩企业成立了14个防御武器子公司{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After your father died, Wayne Enterprises set up 14 different defense subsidiaries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.12,0:38:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些年来 我一直在进行合并{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For years, I've been shuttering and consolidating…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.95,0:38:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,把所有原型机集合在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…all the different prototypes under one roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.50,0:38:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是这里 - 为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My roof. - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.50,0:38:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,以免落入有心人士的手中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep them from falling into the wrong hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.00,0:38:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在炫耀就是了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, now you're just showing off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.59,0:38:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是防御部门的专案计划 城市空战和平防御计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defense Department projects for tight geometry urban pacification.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.72,0:38:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有特殊转子设计 可在水泥丛林里机动飞行 不需要回转{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rotors are configured to maneuver between buildings without recirculation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.77,0:38:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这台叫做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it called?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.89,0:38:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,公司帮它取了一个又臭又长的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it has a long, uninteresting Wayne Enterprises designation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.27,0:38:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都简称它蝙蝠战机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just took to calling it the Bat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.57,0:38:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,依韦恩先生的偏好涂装成黑色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, yes, Mr. Wayne, it does come in black.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.99,0:38:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了自动驾驶以外 其他性能都正常{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Works fine, except for the autopilot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.41,0:38:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,要比我聪明的人才能修好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Takes a better mind than mine to fix it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.50,0:38:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你聪明？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.62,0:39:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是假装谦虚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was trying to be modest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.79,0:39:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有时间就可以修{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A less busy mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.13,0:39:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.97,0:39:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的很痛吗？ - 你要不要来试试看 阿福{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it really painful? - You're very welcome to try it, Alfred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.60,0:39:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用看的就好了 谢谢少爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy watching. Thank you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.44,0:39:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不错嘛…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.90,0:39:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺不赖的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.78,0:39:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你是认真考虑要重操旧业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're seriously considering going back out there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.08,0:39:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该要知道一些贝恩的传闻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you should hear the rumors surrounding Bane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.37,0:39:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all ears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.75,0:39:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,在某个古老的国度有一个地牢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a prison in a more ancient part of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.92,0:39:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一个地洞 犯人被丢进去折磨到死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pit where men are thrown to suffer and die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.01,0:39:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有时候 有人能够从黑暗中升起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But sometimes a man rises from the darkness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.97,0:39:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候 有人能够从地洞中逃出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes the pit sends something back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.27,0:40:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贝恩？ - 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bane. - Bane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.68,0:40:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他生长于人间地狱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Born and raised in hell on earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.90,0:40:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在地牢里出生的？ - 没人知道他是怎么逃出来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Born in a prison? - No one knows why, or how he escaped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.98,0:40:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,只知道他逃出来后…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they do know that once he did…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.74,0:40:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你师父忍者大师门下接受训练{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he was trained by Ra's Al Ghul, your mentor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.07,0:40:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以贝恩也是影武者联盟的一员？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bane was a member of the League of Shadows?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.24,0:40:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来他被驱逐出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then he was excommunicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.87,0:40:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果连忍者大师都认为此人太过偏激{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And any man who is too extreme for Ra's Al Ghul{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.88,0:40:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你绝对不能小看他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is not to be trifled with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.75,0:40:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来就不是个会轻敌的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't realize I was known for trifling with criminals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.63,0:40:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题就在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.38,0:40:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你把腿缠起来 戴上面具{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can strap up your leg and put your mask back on…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.34,0:40:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不可能变回从前的你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but that doesn't make you what you were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.10,0:40:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这个人真的如你说的那样危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this man is everything that you say he is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.01,0:40:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么这个城市需要我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then the city needs me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.89,0:40:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个城市需要的是布鲁斯·韦恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The city needs Bruce Wayne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.23,0:40:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你拥有的资源和知识{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your resources. Your knowledge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.31,0:40:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是你的身体 你的生命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't need your body, or your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.19,0:40:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的时代已经过去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That time's past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.53,0:40:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是担心复出之后 我会失败{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're afraid that if I go back out there, I'll fail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.07,0:40:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.95,0:41:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是担心你想要失败{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid that you want to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.30,0:41:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能因为韦恩参加晚会就放空股票{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't short the stock because Bruce Wayne goes to a party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.68,0:41:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦恩的出现已经引起一些变化 那这变化是好是坏？坏的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wayne coming back is change. Change is either good or bad. I vote bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.64,0:41:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据什么判断？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On what basis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.10,0:41:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,掷铜板决定的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I flipped a coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.78,0:41:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说不要全麦面包！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says rye… I said no rye, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.28,0:41:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,请脱掉安全帽 让摄影机拍得到你的脸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, rookie, lose the helmet. We need faces for camera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.12,0:41:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 我们去倒货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's go scalping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.47,0:42:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱掉吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.58,0:42:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都趴下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody down, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.77,0:42:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是证券交易所 没有钱可以偷的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a stock exchange. There's no money you can steal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.65,0:42:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？那大家在这里做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Then why are you people here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.50,0:43:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都退后 走到街区的尽头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, stay back! Go down to the end of the block!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.42,0:43:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有紧急情况要处理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have an emergency situation!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.68,0:43:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们快进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta get in there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.43,0:43:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是人质挟持事件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a hostage situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.18,0:43:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是抢劫 他们直接进入在线交易网络{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this is a robbery. They have direct access to the online trading desk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.77,0:43:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让我的人冒着生命危险去救你们的钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not risking my men for your money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.81,0:43:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 请你移一下车 这里有一些状况发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to ask you to move. We have a situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.32,0:43:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是我们的钱 是大家的钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not our money, it's everybody's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.53,0:43:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？我的钱都藏在床垫里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Mine's in my mattress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.78,0:43:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不及时阻止这些歹徒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't put these guys down, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.36,0:43:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你藏在床垫里的钱很快就会大幅贬值了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that stuffing in your mattress might be worth a whole lot less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.45,0:43:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,切断光纤线路和移动电话基地台{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut the fiber cable and take out that cell tower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.87,0:43:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 这样可以拖延一点时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - That'll slow them down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.04,0:43:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.42,0:43:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,光纤线路被切断了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They cut the fiber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.17,0:44:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,移动电话网络还可以用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cell's working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.42,0:44:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.43,0:44:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,把路障全给我架起来 这几条街上不许任何人进出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get all these barriers up. All of them up. No one gets in or out of any of these streets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.27,0:44:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要往那个方向移车？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I supposed to move it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.06,0:44:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,升起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.94,0:44:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留在车里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, just stay in your vehicle, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.70,0:44:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还需要多少传输时间？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much longer does the program need?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.71,0:44:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,八分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.46,0:44:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,该行动了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to go mobile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.88,0:44:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.47,0:44:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个 过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.68,0:44:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.93,0:44:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.11,0:44:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.41,0:45:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到目标了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.58,0:45:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要开枪 有人质{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire, they've got hostages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.25,0:45:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.47,0:45:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.69,0:45:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Just let me go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.69,0:45:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 放了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, please! Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.32,0:45:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,打轮胎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot the tires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.90,0:45:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,打不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.78,0:45:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退 撤退 他们有人质{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now back off. Back off, they've got hostages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.08,0:45:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,四名嫌犯挟持了人质{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}P.D. are pursuing the four suspects through downtown…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.00,0:45:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,市中心正上演一场警匪追逐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in response to a hostage situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.55,0:46:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些灯怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on with the lights?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.14,0:46:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能呀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.06,0:46:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.31,0:46:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 今晚有好戏看了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy, you are in for a show tonight, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.65,0:46:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 救救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Help, help, help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.50,0:46:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.17,0:46:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪收好 不然倒霉的是你 上车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put that thing away before you hurt yourself. Get in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.63,0:46:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 快上车 蝙蝠侠出现了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. You, get in the car. They've spotted the Batman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.06,0:47:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把全部的人都叫来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call everyone in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.90,0:47:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的巡逻警察 街头警察 还有没值勤的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every car patrol, beat cop, off-duty too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.36,0:47:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,通通叫来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull them in now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.13,0:47:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在要做的是吉姆·高登未能完成的壮举{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna do what Jim Gordon never could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.24,0:47:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么壮举？ - 我要抓到蝙蝠侠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that? - I'm gonna take down the Batman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.61,0:47:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,四名嫌犯从证券交易所…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}are confirming four suspects are carrying two hostages…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.83,0:47:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,…挟持了两名人质{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…kidnapped from the Gotham Stock Exchange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.04,0:47:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据目击者表示…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reports from the eyewitnesses…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.50,0:47:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看到什么了？ - 我看见蝙蝠侠了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you see? - I see Batman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.08,0:47:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是令人难以置信 现在又有更多嫌疑犯被人追捕…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hard to believe, but the suspects are now being pursued…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.92,0:47:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是蝙蝠侠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…by what appears to be the Batman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.05,0:47:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what do you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.30,0:47:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 那些持枪歹徒怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, what about the armed robbers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.68,0:47:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 放了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Just let me go! Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.32,0:47:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一名嫌犯掉头 没有人质 要追吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One bike's pulled off. No hostage. Should we pursue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.33,0:48:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 跟好蝙蝠侠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative. Stay on the Batman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.79,0:48:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他要逃走了 - 你认为应该抓哪一个？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's getting away. - Who do you wanna catch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.75,0:48:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,无名的抢劫犯？还是杀害哈维·丹特的凶手？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some robber, or the son of a bitch who killed Harvey Dent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.64,0:48:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,八年了 他偏偏选在今晚出现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight years, and he has to pick tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.64,0:48:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把警察从贝恩那边引开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's drawing the cops off Bane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.57,0:48:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 放了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Just let me go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.03,0:48:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.23,0:49:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,（传输完成）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.36,0:49:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟丢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.99,0:49:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能跟丢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you lose him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.82,0:49:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的火力很强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got a lot of firepower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.57,0:49:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就没有吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, and you don't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.45,0:50:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正在往市中心移动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's heading back downtown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.37,0:50:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢说他的脑袋和他的服装一样蠢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he's as dumb as he dresses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.04,0:50:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,包围他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close it off, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.95,0:50:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已成了瓮中之鳖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a rat in a trap, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.62,0:50:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好像不是鳖 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might have the wrong animal there, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.64,0:51:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定是他吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure it was him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.15,0:51:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝恩说尽管蝙蝠侠出面搅局 任务还是圆满达成了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bane says the Batman interfered, but the task was accomplished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.73,0:51:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,被逮捕的手下呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the men they arrested?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.53,0:51:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说「他们死也不会招供」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said, and I quote, "They would die before talking."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.82,0:51:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪雇的这么忠诚的人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where does he find these guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.70,0:51:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开香槟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the champagne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.50,0:51:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以叫一些小姐来吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And can we get some girls in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.17,0:51:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心你的愿望实现啰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful what you wish for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.60,0:51:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,被猫咬到舌头了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cat got your tongue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.10,0:51:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个愚蠢的婊子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You dumb bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.48,0:51:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没人说我愚蠢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody ever accused me of being dumb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.73,0:51:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚来这里就很愚蠢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dumb for coming here tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.07,0:51:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,交出你欠我的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want what you owe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.57,0:52:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,门都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want doesn't get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.99,0:52:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这身装扮不错 高跟鞋会不会不好走路？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice outfit. Those heels make it tough to walk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.20,0:52:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.04,0:52:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.75,0:52:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在哪里？ - 什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So where is it? - Where's what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.54,0:52:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个「洗底」软件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The program. The "clean slate."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.13,0:52:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,盗贼梦寐以求的终极工具吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ultimate tool for a master thief with a record.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.09,0:52:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it right there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.15,0:52:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.73,0:52:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,「洗底」软件？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The clean slate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.48,0:52:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要在程序里输入一个人的姓名 生日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you type in someone's name, date of birth…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.28,0:52:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,几分钟后 就可以把他从全世界的数据库消除？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in a few minutes they're gone from every database on earth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.99,0:52:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这么好的东西听起来像真的吗？ - 你骗人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sound a little too good to be true? - You're lying!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.95,0:52:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,铼京公司已经发展到测试阶段{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rykin Data took it to prototype stage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.70,0:52:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才买下它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I bought them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.58,0:52:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他们什么也没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they had nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.88,0:52:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是虚构的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a gangland myth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.93,0:53:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.48,0:53:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说着玩的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not bluffing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.02,0:53:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.81,0:53:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他们不在乎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just don't care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.58,0:53:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开什么玩笑？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've gotta be kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.04,0:53:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不准开枪 不准杀人 - 那还有什么乐趣？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No guns. No killing. - Where's the fun in that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.73,0:54:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈说不可以搭陌生人的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother warned me about getting into cars with strange men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.69,0:54:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这台不是车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.87,0:54:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见啰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.45,0:54:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.96,0:54:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况都在我的掌控之下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had it under control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.50,0:54:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些人可不是普通的混混{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those weren't street thugs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.00,0:55:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是受过训练的杀手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were trained killers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.25,0:55:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救了你一命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.13,0:55:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 你把布鲁斯·韦恩的指纹交给谁了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In return, I need to know what you did with Bruce Wayne's fingerprints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.05,0:55:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来韦恩真的有个厉害的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wayne wasn't kidding about a powerful friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.76,0:55:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把他的指纹卖给达格先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sold his prints to Daggett…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.60,0:55:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,换来的却是一项不存在的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for something that doesn't even exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.35,0:55:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信他能占到你的便宜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt many people get the better of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.68,0:55:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,女孩子走投无路的时候…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, when a girl's desperate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.23,0:55:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他要用来做什么？ - 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's he gonna do with them? - I don't know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.73,0:55:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过达格十分关注证券交易所的那场抢案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but Daggett seemed pretty interested in that mess at the stock market.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.37,0:55:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯尔小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Kyle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.75,0:55:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来是这种感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's what that feels like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.27,0:56:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到你上新闻 你又出去搞破坏了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see from the television coverage that you got your taste for wanton destruction back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.98,0:56:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿到这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I retrieved this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.11,0:56:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,调查证物不是警方的工作吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't the police supposed to be investigating, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.74,0:56:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们没有分析工具 - 你把你的工具交给他们就有啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They don't have the tools to analyze it. - They would if you gave them to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.32,0:56:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人的工具可能成为另一个人的武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One man's tool is another man's weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.99,0:56:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你这种偏执狂来说 什么都能变成武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your mind, perhaps. But there aren't many things you can't turn into a weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.50,0:56:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿福 别说了 警方根本做不了事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alfred, enough. The police weren't getting it done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.79,0:56:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,若不是你出来闹场 说不定他们早就抓到凶手了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps they might have if you hadn't made a sideshow of yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.34,0:56:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你就是认为我做不到 - 你只是让警方把你追得团团转{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You thought I didn't have it in me. - You led a bloated police force on a chase…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.30,0:56:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,用福克斯给你的新玩具耍耍特技{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with a load of fancy new toys from Fox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.05,0:56:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你只身面对那些暴徒时 你要怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about when you come up against him? What then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.69,0:56:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会更奋力搏斗 像从前那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll fight harder. I always have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.31,0:56:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仔细看 他的敏捷 他的残暴 他的训练{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look. His speed, his ferocity, his training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.02,0:56:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见信仰的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see the power of belief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.85,0:56:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见影武者联盟即将再起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see the League of Shadows resurgent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.94,0:56:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说他被驱逐出门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said he was excommunicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.57,0:56:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,被忍者大师逐出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By Ra's Al Ghul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.49,0:56:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道现在的首领是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who leads them now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.74,0:56:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,忍者大师是影武者联盟的首领 我已经打败他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ra's Al Ghul was the League of Shadows and I beat him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.49,0:56:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝恩只是一介佣兵 我们要查出他究竟想做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bane is a mercenary. We need to find out what he's up to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.45,0:57:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来像是某种交易 被加密了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trades of some kind. Coded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.83,0:57:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我的指纹… 拜瑟琳娜·凯尔之赐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my fingerprint, courtesy of Selina Kyle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.79,0:57:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个拿给福克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get this to Fox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.04,0:57:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可以破解密码 查出他们从事什么交易{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can crack the code and tell us what trades they were executing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.05,0:57:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把这交给福克斯 然后就到此为止{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get this to Mr. Fox, but no more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.39,0:57:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把你拉扯大 教你做人的道理 我不愿亲手埋葬你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've sewn you up, I've set your bones, but I won't bury you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.35,0:57:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经为韦恩家族送走了太多人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've buried enough members of the Wayne family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.27,0:57:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要离开我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll leave me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.54,0:57:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是认为你的人生只有一种结局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see only one end to your journey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.07,0:57:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能通过辞职来让你了解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leaving is all I have to make you understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.95,0:57:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已不再是蝙蝠侠 你必须寻求其他的生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not Batman anymore. You have to find another way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.62,0:57:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾说过要退出江湖 去过正常人的生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used to talk about finishing, about a life beyond that awful cave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.75,0:57:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿福 瑞秋死了 我们曾许诺要厮守一生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alfred, Rachel died knowing that we had decided to be together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.63,0:57:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,正常人的生活已成为过去式 我无法继续我的人生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was my life beyond the cave. I can't just move on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.97,0:57:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她… 她不能…她本来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She… She didn't. She couldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.64,0:57:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if she had?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.18,0:58:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不可能改变这一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She… I can't change that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.81,0:58:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,假使她死之前曾写一封信告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if before she died she wrote a letter…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.98,0:58:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她选择的是哈维·丹特 而不是你？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…saying she chose Harvey Dent over you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.82,0:58:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,假使为了怕你受伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what if to spare you pain…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.91,0:58:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把那封信烧掉了呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I burnt that letter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.62,0:58:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竟敢利用瑞秋来企图阻止我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you use Rachel to try to stop me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.04,0:58:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是真的 韦恩少爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am using the truth, Master Wayne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.13,0:58:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们都不该再继续隐瞒事实 就让真相大白吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's time we all stopped trying to outsmart the truth and let it have its day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.63,0:58:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很抱歉 - 抱歉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - You're sorry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.93,0:58:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为可以无情地摧毁我的世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You expect to destroy my world…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.01,0:58:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再跟我握手言和？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and then think that we're gonna shake hands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.56,0:58:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.48,0:58:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很清楚会有什么后果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what this means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.73,0:58:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么后果？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.98,0:58:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,后果就是…你会恨我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means your hatred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.61,0:58:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我也会失去一个人 从他出生的那天起…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it also means losing someone that I have cared for…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.49,0:59:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就一直照料的那个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…since I first heard his cries echo through this house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.00,0:59:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我也可能因此救了你一条命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it might also mean saving your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.54,0:59:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是我的重点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is more important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.18,0:59:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了 阿福{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Alfred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.99,0:59:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿福？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alfred?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.41,0:59:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你亲自来开门？ - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Answering your own door? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.42,0:59:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看第三页{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Page three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.25,0:59:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你在期货交易市场上买进了大量的卖权{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems you made a series of large put options on the futures exchange verified by thumbprint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.88,1:00:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些卖权的履约期限在昨晚到期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those options expired at midnight last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.72,1:00:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我们最终可证明这是一场诈骗 但现在你已完全破产{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long-term, we may be able to prove fraud. But for now, you're completely broke…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.93,1:00:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦恩企业很快就会落入约翰·达格的手中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and Wayne Enterprises is about to fall into the hands of John Daggett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.52,1:00:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些武器…我们绝不能让达格染指那些武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The weapons. We can't let Daggett get his hands on Applied Sciences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.52,1:00:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些武器已经被锁起来 而且是帐外资产{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Applied Sciences is all locked up and off the books.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.65,1:00:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是能源计划就难保了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The energy project, however, is a different story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.03,1:00:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,米兰达·泰特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miranda Tate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.53,1:00:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要说服董事会支持她 带她去看反应器吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's convince the board to get behind her. Let's show her the reactor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.99,1:00:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,35分钟后和她会面 你赶紧换衣服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're meeting her there in 35 minutes, so you better get dressed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.83,1:00:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带我来这里就为了看这个 福克斯先生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought me out here to show me this, Mr. Fox?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.58,1:00:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要有点耐心 泰特小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bear with me, Miss Tate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.26,1:00:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要把手脚伸出车厢外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please keep hands and feet inside the car at all times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.31,1:00:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.68,1:00:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,反应器放在河流下方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reactor is beneath the river…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.81,1:00:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有安全缺口的时候 可以轻易用洪水淹没它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so it can be instantly flooded in the event of a security breach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.27,1:01:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯·韦恩真的是个偏执狂吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Bruce Wayne really that paranoid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.36,1:01:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恐怕无法回答这个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna plead the fifth on that one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.54,1:01:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该想瞧瞧你所投资的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you might like to see what your investment built.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.62,1:01:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再使用石化燃料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No fossil fuels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.46,1:01:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个城市都能享用免费的干净能源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free clean energy for an entire city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.21,1:01:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,三年前 有位俄罗斯科学家发表一篇论文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three years ago, a Russian scientist published a paper…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.92,1:01:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用核融合反应制作武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…on weaponized fusion reactions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.38,1:01:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一周后 你们就宣称反应器研发遇到瓶颈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One week later, your reactor started developing problems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.56,1:01:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜这机器运转根本没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this machine works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.35,1:01:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,米兰达 如果启动这台机器 高谭市可能会陷入很大的危机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miranda, if it were operational, the danger to Gotham would be too great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.15,1:01:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那位俄罗斯科学家已经在六个月前坠机丧生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would it make you feel better to know that the Russian scientist…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.40,1:01:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以不用那么担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…died in a plane crash six months ago?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.36,1:01:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有心人士一定会研究帕佛博士的论文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone will work out what Dr. Pavel did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.03,1:01:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把这机器改造成核子武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone will figure out a way to make this power source into a nuclear weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.54,1:02:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能接手韦恩企业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to take control of Wayne Enterprises…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.38,1:02:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,和这台反应器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and this reactor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.05,1:02:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后怎么处理？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To do what with it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.34,1:02:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也不做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.43,1:02:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我们确保它安全无虞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until we can guarantee its safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.72,1:02:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果做不到呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we can't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.22,1:02:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,用洪水淹了它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decommission it. Flood it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.93,1:02:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧毁这个世上最佳的永续能源机会？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroy the world's best chance for a sustainable future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.89,1:02:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这世界还没准备好 就这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the world's not ready, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.69,1:02:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 如果你要拯救这个世界 就要先学会相信它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce, if you want to save the world, you have to start trusting it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.36,1:02:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trusting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.90,1:02:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不算数 你是别无选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't count. You have no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.61,1:02:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去三年来 我随时可以把这里淹掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have flooded this chamber at any time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.12,1:02:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我选择相信你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm choosing to trust you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.03,1:02:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.50,1:02:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 会议现在开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, ladies and gentlemen. This meeting will now come to order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.76,1:02:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想提醒大家 在座有一位不是我们董事会成员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to point out that we have a non-board member here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.09,1:02:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不符合议事规则 就算门上挂着他家的姓氏也不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which is highly irregular, even if his family name is above the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.60,1:02:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这间公司可是布鲁斯·韦恩的家族一手建立的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce Wayne's family built this company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.02,1:02:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是他在运营公司{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he himself has run it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.93,1:03:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞得快垮了 你们不同意吗？去看看今天上午的股价{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into the ground, sir! Does anybody disagree? Check the share price this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.86,1:03:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯狂式的期货投机行为不但让韦恩先生自己丢掉董事席位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy gambling on futures has not only cost Mr. Wayne his seat…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.28,1:03:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,也害我们所有人都损失惨重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it's cost us all a lot of money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.74,1:03:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定要离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he has to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.45,1:03:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说得很有道理 韦恩先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid he has a point, Mr. Wayne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.88,1:03:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在谈公司的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, back to business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.25,1:03:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 韦恩先生 这边 - 变成平民百姓您有什么感受？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Wayne, over here! - How's it feel to be one of the people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.63,1:03:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦恩先生 他们要把你的车拖走 我不知道要怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Wayne, they're towing your car! I didn't know what to do, they had paperwork.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.43,1:03:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,来搭我的便车吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you need a ride, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.31,1:03:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦恩先生 您要搭便车吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wayne, we'll give you a ride!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.68,1:03:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,米兰达·泰特为什么会得到韦恩派系的董事支持？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell did Miranda Tate get the inside track on the Wayne board?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.15,1:03:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有跟他见面吗？有跟他上床吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She been meeting with him? Sleeping with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.48,1:03:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 据我们所知 没有 - 显然你什么都搞不清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not that we know of. - You don't know much of anything, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.61,1:03:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贝恩在哪？ - 我已经跟他说事态紧急{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Bane? - We told him it was urgent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.69,1:03:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他到底在… - 说曹操 曹操到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is that masked… - Speak of the devil and he shall appear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.91,1:03:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.99,1:04:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一切都按照预期计划进行了 - 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The plan is proceeding as expected. - Oh, really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.54,1:04:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在看起来像是取得韦恩企业的经营权了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I look like I'm running Wayne Enterprises right now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.63,1:04:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你袭击证券交易所的招数 根本没有奏效{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hit on the stock exchange, it didn't work, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.34,1:04:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你利用我的营造公司在这个城市里24小时不停工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you have my construction crews going around the city at 24 hours a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.64,1:04:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么做对我吞并韦恩公司的目标有什么帮助？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How exactly is that supposed to help my company absorb Wayne's?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.14,1:04:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你先出去 - 不用 你留下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Leave us. - No. You stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.69,1:04:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才是这里的老大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.07,1:04:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的觉得你是老大？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you feel in charge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.49,1:04:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经付你一笔钱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've paid you a small fortune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.41,1:04:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为这样就可以骑在我头上？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this gives you power over me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.95,1:04:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.54,1:04:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的资金和营造团队确实帮了我大忙 但现在已经没用了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your money and infrastructure have been important till now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.50,1:04:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.80,1:04:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是高谭市的末日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Gotham's reckoning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.80,1:04:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来帮大家为这个诅咒画下句点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here to end the borrowed time you've all been living on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.72,1:04:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才是真正的恶魔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pure evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.02,1:05:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是必要之恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm necessary evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.48,1:05:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.98,1:05:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么想到要戴面具？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you started, why the mask?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.61,1:05:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为了保护我身边的人 - 但你不是孤家寡人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To protect the people closest to me. - But you were a loner, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.45,1:05:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有家人吗？ - 总有一些我关心的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You didn't have any family? - There are always people you care about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.74,1:05:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直到失去他们后 我才能真正体会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just don't realize how much until they're gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.08,1:05:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个构想是要形成一种象征{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The idea was to be a symbol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.12,1:05:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人都可以是蝙蝠侠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batman could be anybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.79,1:05:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是重点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.71,1:05:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我真的很高兴你能回来 - 有些人可不这么想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, it was damn good to see him back. - Not everybody agrees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.13,1:05:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们最后都会想通的 - 你有任何关于贝恩行踪的线索吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They'll figure that out in the end. - You got anything on Bane's whereabouts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.89,1:05:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有500页的地道资料和一把手电筒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I got 500 pages of tunnel records and a flashlight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.27,1:05:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来帮我找{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could use some help, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.35,1:05:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧 送我去旧城区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Drop me in Old Town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.86,1:05:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不这么认为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey. I don't think so!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.61,1:05:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 事情就是这样 - 我不这么认为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's the way this works! - I don't think so!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.95,1:05:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 事情就是… - 他不是我们的目标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That is the way… - He's not a mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.36,1:05:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他现在也没有钱了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he doesn't have a cent to his name, anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.53,1:06:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,敝舍很寒酸 不过应该比你现在的家好多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's not much. But it's more than you've got right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.00,1:06:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 他们让我继续住那栋房子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, they're letting me keep the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.58,1:06:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来有钱人破产的方式也跟我们不太一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rich don't even go broke the same as the rest of us, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.34,1:06:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那个厉害的朋友希望你可以不要离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My powerful friend might hope to change your mind about leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.46,1:06:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他可以给我什么好处？ - 帮你弄到你想要的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And how would he do that? - By giving you what you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.26,1:06:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那东西根本不存在 - 他说有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It doesn't exist. - He says it does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.64,1:06:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚他想跟你见个面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to meet tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.51,1:06:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.72,1:06:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想找贝恩 他说你知道门路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs to find Bane. Says you'd know how.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.98,1:06:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟他说我会考虑的 - 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell him I'll think about it. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.36,1:06:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很喜欢你的公寓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like your place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.69,1:06:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦恩先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Wayne?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.45,1:06:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉他们把你的钱全偷走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry they took all your money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.78,1:06:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才不会抱歉呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.20,1:06:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有什么事要报告吗？ - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can we help you, officer? - Uh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.16,1:06:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个钟头前发现约翰·达格的尸体被弃置在垃圾车里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Daggett's body was just found in a Dumpster about an hour ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.88,1:06:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个线索可能有点用 - 为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thought you might want to know. - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.00,1:06:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,高谭市大部分地下工程施工许可证上都有他的签名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name's all over these permits I just pulled to, uh, map the tunnels under Gotham.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.30,1:07:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括地铁隧道、地下管线、下水道工程等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's MTA maintenance, uh, sewer construction, couple of other things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.35,1:07:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么没调查地下通道？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get to with the tunnel searches?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.52,1:07:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这热血青年是来提醒我的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remind me to tell detail to keep hotheads out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.56,1:07:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们派了几个小组下去 那是个巨大的地下网络{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've had teams down there. It's a huge network.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.90,1:07:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,加派一些人手 一处都不能漏掉 要抓到他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, get more men. Work a grid. I want him found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.40,1:07:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 面罩怪人 我们已经在搜查了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the, uh, masked man. We're on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.90,1:07:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再穿这身制服了 现在开始你在我下面做事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lose the uniform, you're working for me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.82,1:07:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要很多热血青年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could use some hotter heads around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.41,1:07:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 达格的死亡也有可能是巧合 - 你现在的身份是警探{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir, that could also be a coincidence. - You're a detective now, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.70,1:07:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能再相信世上有巧合这种事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not allowed to believe in coincidence anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.01,1:07:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人帮你开门吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's answering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.93,1:07:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.26,1:07:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只剩我一个人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on my own now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.77,1:07:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有钥匙吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have keys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.39,1:07:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没用过那种东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never needed them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.23,1:07:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你不是因为钱才喜欢我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope you didn't like me for my money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.74,1:08:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,困顿的环境可以升华你的人格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suffering builds character.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.37,1:08:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会好好照顾你父母的遗物 布鲁斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take care of your parents' legacy, Bruce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.08,1:08:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.26,1:08:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿福去哪了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Alfred?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.39,1:08:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.43,1:08:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,把一切都带走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…taking everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.37,1:08:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.54,1:08:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,被断电了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My power's been shut off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.34,1:09:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很会升火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're good at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.93,1:09:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,小时候 我们一贫如洗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was a child, we had almost nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.31,1:09:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜里升起火 就会感觉内心非常富足{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But on the nights when we had a fire, we felt very rich indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.65,1:09:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你来自富裕的家庭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assumed your family was wealthy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.40,1:09:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是一开始就有钱 小时候很穷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not always. Not when I was young.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.11,1:09:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一段往事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An old mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.07,1:09:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有一些往事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've made a few myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.20,1:09:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不少呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than a few.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.08,1:09:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.08,1:09:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天晚上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.00,1:09:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,搭我的飞机 到任何我们想去的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take my plane, go anywhere we wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.84,1:09:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,改天吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someday, perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.59,1:09:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.25,1:10:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别害羞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be shy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.25,1:10:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦恩说你可以弄到「洗底」软件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wayne says you can get me the clean slate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.01,1:10:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那要看情况 - 什么情况？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That depends. - On what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.93,1:10:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你的用途{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On what you want it for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.72,1:10:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我买下它是为了避免落入坏人手中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I acquired it to keep it out of the wrong hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.43,1:10:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像不信任我嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still don't trust me, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.31,1:10:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样才能让你相信我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can we change that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.52,1:10:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,先带我去见贝恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start by taking me to Bane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.36,1:10:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你自找的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.24,1:10:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这里开始就会有贝恩的人巡逻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From here, Bane's men patrol the tunnels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.61,1:10:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是普通的混混{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're not your average brawlers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.57,1:10:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither am l.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.88,1:11:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在你后面 - 谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's behind you. - Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.13,1:11:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.34,1:11:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think you're…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.44,1:11:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,快到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a little further.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.86,1:11:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总得想个办法保护我自己的性命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to find a way to stop them trying to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.58,1:11:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你铸下大错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made a serious mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.58,1:11:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你铸下的错恐怕更严重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not as serious as yours, I fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.17,1:11:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.38,1:11:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就不必客套了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's not stand on ceremony here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.72,1:11:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦恩先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Mr. Wayne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.27,1:12:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,和平会消磨你的力量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peace has cost you your strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.61,1:12:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜利会挫败你的意志{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victory has defeated you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.21,1:13:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这障眼法只能用来对付未受训练的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theatricality and deception, powerful agents to the uninitiated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.01,1:13:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都受过训练 不是吗 布鲁斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we are initiated, aren't we, Bruce?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.72,1:13:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,同出身于影武者联盟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Members of the League of Shadows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.56,1:13:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你背叛了我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you betrayed us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.77,1:13:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 而你被一群丧心病狂驱逐出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Us"? You were excommunicated by a gang of psychopaths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.87,1:13:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是影武者联盟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the League of Shadows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.95,1:13:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来完成忍者大师的遗志{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm here to fulfill Ra's Al Ghul's destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.64,1:13:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你像年轻人般地奋战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fight like a younger man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.89,1:14:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无保留{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing held back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.35,1:14:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人钦佩 但你错估了形势{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admirable, but mistaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.98,1:14:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为黑暗是你的盟友？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you think darkness is your ally?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.74,1:14:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你只是利用了黑暗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you merely adopted the dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.11,1:14:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我则是生于黑暗之中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was born in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.74,1:14:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,长于黑暗之中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Molded by it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.04,1:14:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我长大成人才首次见到光明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't see the light until I was already a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.29,1:14:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之前只有无尽的黑夜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}By then, it was nothing to me but blinding!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.55,1:14:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗出卖了你 因为我才是黑暗的支配者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shadows betray you because they belong to me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.89,1:14:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带你去看我的家乡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will show you where I have made my home…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.27,1:14:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在此同时 我们将准备让正义得到伸张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…whilst preparing to bring justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.81,1:14:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 再把你粉碎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I will break you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.78,1:15:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于你提供的珍贵武器 深表谢意 正合所需{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your precious armory. Gratefully accepted. We will need it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.38,1:15:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,对嘛 我还在想说要先粉碎哪一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yes. I was wondering what would break first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.93,1:15:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意志…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your spirit…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.15,1:15:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是你的身体？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or your body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.86,1:16:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我接高登局长 议员绑架案有线索了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me Commissioner Gordon. I got a line on the congressman's kidnapping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.08,1:16:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打扰一下 小姐 - 有事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me, miss. - Uh, yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.42,1:16:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以让我看一下你的机票和身份证件吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need to see your ticket and identification, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.75,1:16:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 帮我拿一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Do you mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.60,1:16:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把你的照片拿给议员看 你猜怎么着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I showed your picture to the congressman. Guess what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.02,1:16:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了 他还爱着我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me. Still in love?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.73,1:17:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱得死去活来 他提起告诉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, head over heels. Pressing charges, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.32,1:17:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有过不少前科 凯尔小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've made some mistakes, Ms. Kyle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.16,1:17:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只是混口饭吃 - 你胃口很大嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Girl's gotta eat. - And you have an appetite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.66,1:17:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要逃走？前科累累 想躲过警察也很难{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you run? You can't hide with a record like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.08,1:17:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是在躲警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's not you I'm running from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.29,1:17:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是躲谁？贝恩吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who then? Bane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.34,1:17:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他哪些事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.84,1:17:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该和我一样怕他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you should be as afraid of him as I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.47,1:17:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以提供庇护{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can offer you protection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.64,1:17:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.35,1:17:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是因为在找一个朋友才盯上你的 布鲁斯·韦恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I spotted you, I was looking for a friend of mine. Bruce Wayne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.73,1:17:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把他杀了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did they kill him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.99,1:17:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.42,1:18:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何不干脆杀了我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you just kill me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.39,1:18:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样太便宜你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't fear death, you welcome it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.39,1:18:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须接受更严厉的惩罚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your punishment must be more severe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.90,1:18:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,折磨我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Torture?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.81,1:18:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.86,1:18:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是你的身体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not of your body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.41,1:18:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是你的灵魂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of your soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.32,1:18:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am l?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.99,1:18:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,家乡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.99,1:18:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里我学到了什么是真正的绝望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where I learned the truth about despair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.92,1:18:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快你也会学到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As will you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.88,1:18:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地牢是最可怕的人间地狱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a reason why this prison is the worst hell on earth:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.26,1:18:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有「希望」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.80,1:18:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,数千年来 这里的囚犯无不抬头仰望那道光明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every man who has rotted here over the centuries…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.09,1:18:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,幻想着爬出地牢重获自由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…has looked up to the light and imagined climbing to freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.60,1:18:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这么容易 这么单纯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So easy. So simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.06,1:19:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如同大海里的船难漂流者 饮海水止渴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And like shipwrecked men turning to seawater from uncontrollable thirst…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.74,1:19:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人都因此摔死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…many have died trying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.57,1:19:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是因为存在希望 才有真正的绝望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I learned here there can be no true despair without hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.16,1:19:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以当我的恐怖笼罩高谭市时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So as I terrorize Gotham…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.00,1:19:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会利用这点来折磨他们的灵魂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I will feed its people hope to poison their souls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.38,1:19:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们以为还有一丝生存的希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will let them believe that they can survive…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.09,1:19:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后看着他们踩着彼此的身体争相爬向阳光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so that you can watch them clambering over each other to stay in the sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.89,1:19:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将会眼睁睁地看我们折磨这座城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can watch me torture an entire city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.68,1:19:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候你就会明白自己有多失败{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then when you have truly understood the depth of your failure…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.60,1:19:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定会完成忍者大师的遗愿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we will fulfill Ra's Al Ghul's destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.23,1:19:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会摧毁高谭市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will destroy Gotham.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.45,1:19:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,当使命完成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, when it is done…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.37,1:19:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,高谭市化成灰烬时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and Gotham is ashes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.88,1:20:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就可以领死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then you have my permission to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.94,1:20:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她要被关在这里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're locking her up in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.60,1:20:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据丹特法案 特殊情况可以不需要隔离{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Dent Act allows non-segregation based on extraordinary need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.61,1:20:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她16岁就从女子感化监狱逃出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First time she broke out of women's correctional, she was 16.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.86,1:20:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 靠过来一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little closer, baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.20,1:20:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,想牵牵我的小手吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, honey? You wanna hold my hand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.66,1:20:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会有什么问题的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.24,1:20:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何董事会要开会讨论能源计划？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still don't see the need of a board meeting for the energy project.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.58,1:20:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯做了很多正确的决策{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce got a lot of things right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.33,1:20:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是不应该瞒着董事会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeping the board in the dark was not one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.42,1:20:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎你们加入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How good of you to join us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.59,1:20:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,主席 董事长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chair. President.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.38,1:20:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我还需要一名董事会成员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I need now is one more ordinary board member.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.22,1:20:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,福克斯先生 不如你帮我选一位吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Fox, would you like to nominate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.81,1:21:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 我自愿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I will volunteer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.14,1:21:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把我们带去哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you taking us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.45,1:21:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说对了 局长 可以让我们说个话吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right, commissioner. Will you excuse us, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.62,1:21:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.83,1:21:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,面罩怪人绑架了韦恩企业董事会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your masked man kidnapped the Wayne Enterprises board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.12,1:21:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分的成员都释放了 不过他把三个人带进了下水道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He let most of them go, but he took three into the sewers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.21,1:21:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要巡逻了 不能再玩捉迷藏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more patrols. No more hide and seek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.71,1:21:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,把所有能调动的警力都派下去 把他们揪出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get every available cop down there and smoke him out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.59,1:21:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,市长不希望引起恐慌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mayor won't want panic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.30,1:21:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就对外说是演习？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's a training exercise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.89,1:21:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉我先前没把你当一回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I didn't take you seriously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.10,1:21:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.31,1:21:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要负责向我报告蝙蝠侠的行踪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're telling me the Batman's gone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.85,1:21:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你去追查达格的那条线 要不择手段{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so you chase up the Daggett leads any way you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.90,1:21:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.37,1:22:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他问你愿意付多少钱求我们让你死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asks how much you would pay us to let you die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.00,1:22:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他说你一贫如洗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him. I told him you have nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.75,1:22:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就请他当作是消遣让我一死吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it for the pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.50,1:22:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他付我们一笔钱让你维持生命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They pay me more than that to keep you alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.26,1:22:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人要尝试爬出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will try the climb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.57,1:22:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人成功过吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has anyone ever made it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.95,1:22:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.92,1:22:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说有一个人成功过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says there is one who did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.22,1:22:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.05,1:23:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个地狱里出生的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A child born in this hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.01,1:23:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.81,1:23:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是个传说罢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An old legend. Nothing more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.69,1:23:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.02,1:23:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要你亲眼目睹的惨剧 就快要开始了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is they want you to see, it's happening soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.05,1:23:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,引爆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire in the hole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.54,1:24:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn it on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.76,1:24:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要再抓一个董事过来就好 还有八个人在等着呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only need one other board member. There are eight others waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.76,1:24:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕难从命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.72,1:24:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 住手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.31,1:24:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢修斯 你会害死这个人和你自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucius, you'll kill this man, and yourself…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.39,1:24:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么做也拖延不了多少时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and you'll barely slow them down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.80,1:25:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 做你的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, then. Do your work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.01,1:25:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它展现给世人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take them up to the surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.30,1:25:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,人民有权体验…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}People of their status…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.35,1:25:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,西方文明的新世代{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…deserve to experience the next era of western civilization.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.61,1:25:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我调查到达格的水泥工厂向多个地点的地下管道灌注了水泥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been to half of Daggett's cement plants and locations they poured underground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.90,1:25:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,灌入的东西有没有可疑之处？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything strange about the pourings?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.82,1:25:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,坦白说 局长 我对土木工程一窍不通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, commissioner, I don't know anything about civil engineering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.41,1:25:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你熟悉行为模式 继续调查{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know about patterns. Keep looking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.75,1:25:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.04,1:25:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这是一颗四百万吨的核子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is now a 4-megaton nuclear bomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.63,1:25:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,把核心从反应器卸下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull the core out of the reactor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.93,1:25:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不可以这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you cannot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.14,1:25:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是唯一能够维持它稳定的能源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the only power source capable of sustaining it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.23,1:25:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你卸下来 几个月后核心就会劣化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you move it, the core will decay in a matter of months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.23,1:25:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,五个月 根据我推算{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five, by my calculations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.57,1:26:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样会爆炸的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then it will go off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.03,1:26:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了你的孩子着想 帕佛博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for the sake of your children, Dr. Pavel…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.16,1:26:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,它最好要给我爆炸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…indeed I hope it does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.08,1:26:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.71,1:26:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在证券交易所门口见过你 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was you in front of the stock exchange, wasn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.46,1:26:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么时候？ - 什么时候？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When? - When?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.30,1:26:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察要封锁街道的时候 你的卡车挡到了路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When cops were trying to pull onto Castle Street and your truck was shutting them out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.76,1:26:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 你就是那个警察 - 现在是警探了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yeah. You're the cop. - Detective now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.47,1:26:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,身为警探 我不相信这世上有所谓的巧合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, as a detective, we're not allowed to believe in coincidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.23,1:26:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会在这里？你们要做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you doing here? What are you working on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.74,1:26:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,局长 我是布莱克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commissioner, it's Blake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.45,1:26:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到两个死亡的目击者 留下一堆疑问 请回电…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got two dead witnesses and a lot of questions. Call me whenev…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.42,1:27:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我看到四桶聚异丁烯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. I'm looking at four barrels of polyisobutylene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.55,1:27:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是在制作水泥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That looks like motor oil right next to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.97,1:27:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是做炸药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, they're not making cement. They're making explosives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.89,1:27:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 帮我转接佛利 - 佛利正在执行任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Patch me in to Foley. - Foley's overseeing the operation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.81,1:27:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们进去的地道是陷阱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're heading into a trap!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.40,1:27:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看到数千名警力进入下水道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're seeing thousands of police heading into the sewers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.19,1:27:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请问市长 数以千计的警力… - 这只是演习活动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Mayor? Literally thousands. - It's a training exercise, that's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.82,1:27:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,若不介意 我现在要进去看本市的球队痛宰对手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now if you'll excuse me, I've got tickets to watch our boys thrash Rapid City.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.79,1:27:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是佛利 - 那是陷阱 快叫大家出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Foley. - It's a trap! Pull everyone out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.96,1:27:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贝恩把炸药混入水泥灌进地底下 - 在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bane has been pouring concrete laced with explosives! - Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.88,1:27:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 哦 你能在黎明的晨光中看到吗 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, say, can you see By the dawn's early light ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.26,1:27:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们在暮色中如此骄傲地欢呼 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ What so proudly we hailed At the twilight's… ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.27,1:28:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下通道周围一整圈 他们计划要把警方困在地底下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a ring around the tunnels! They'll blow it and trap the cops underground!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.11,1:28:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,快撤退 把大家撤出来 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull them out. Pull them out now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.11,1:28:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在危险的战斗中 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Through the perilous fight ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.70,1:28:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们看到的城墙 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ O'er the ramparts we watched ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.03,1:28:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 是如此的殷勤 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Were so gallantly streaming ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.54,1:28:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 火箭的红光 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And the rockets' red glare ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.96,1:28:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 炸弹在空中爆炸 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ The bombs bursting in air ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.17,1:28:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么动人的歌声啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a lovely, lovely voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.51,1:28:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们的旗帜还在那里 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ …that our flag was still there ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.43,1:28:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 哦 那星条旗还在飘扬吗 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Oh, say does that star-spangled banner Yet wave ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.65,1:28:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 自由之地 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ O'er the land of the free ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.61,1:28:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 勇敢者的家 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And the home of the brave ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.13,1:29:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏开始了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the games begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.38,1:30:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.13,1:30:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们行动吧 - 快 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's move! Move, move! - Go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.98,1:30:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,高谭市的市民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotham…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.28,1:30:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在起接管…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…take control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.20,1:30:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,接管你们的城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take control of your city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.83,1:31:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 佛利 - 我的天啊 布莱克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Foley. - Jesus, Blake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.87,1:31:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部的警力都困在地底下了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every cop in the city's in those tunnels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.88,1:31:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是全部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not every cop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.31,1:31:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 你没事吧？我是警察 我现在需要用你的车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, are you okay? I'm a police officer. I need your car right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.53,1:32:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘了检查角落 菜鸟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear the corners, rookie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.66,1:32:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我拿外套 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get my coat, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.08,1:32:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这台就是解放你们的机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This…This is the instrument of your liberation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.46,1:32:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星侦测到放射波段{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satellite shows a radiation spike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.13,1:32:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 那是个核子武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is, it's nuclear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.89,1:32:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,向大家自我介绍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ldentify yourself to the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.47,1:32:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是蓝尼·帕佛 核物理学家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Leonid Pavel, nuclear physicist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.27,1:32:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕佛被证实死于空难{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pavel was confirmed dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.77,1:32:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,从乌兹别克撤离的途中 但…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plane crash on an agency pull out of Uzbekistan, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.32,1:33:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来是他没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like it's him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.74,1:33:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉大家这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what… What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.16,1:33:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个完全启动的中子炸弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a fully primed neutron bomb…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.20,1:33:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸半径6英里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with a blast radius of six miles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.41,1:33:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能够解除这个装置？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who is capable of disarming such a device?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.88,1:33:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我一人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.92,1:33:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你一人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.55,1:33:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, good doctor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.43,1:33:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了 这个炸弹已经启动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, this bomb is armed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.89,1:33:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个炸弹会到处移动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this bomb is mobile!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.64,1:33:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人知道引爆者的身份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the identity of the triggerman is a mystery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.73,1:33:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为引爆器握在你们其中一人的手里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For one of you holds the detonator!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.74,1:33:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是要征服这个城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we come here not as conquerors…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.28,1:33:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是要解放这个城市 把这个城市主控权交还给市民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but as liberators, to return control of this city to the people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.08,1:33:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦发现外界伸出援手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And at the first sign of interference from the outside world…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.50,1:34:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是有人企图逃跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or from those people attempting to flee…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.22,1:34:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位无名的高谭市民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…this anonymous Gothamite…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.01,1:34:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位不被歌颂的英雄就会引爆炸弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…this unsung hero, will trigger the bomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.31,1:34:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在起实施戒严{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For now, martial law is in effect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.40,1:34:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位先回家 拥抱你的家人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return to your homes, hold your families close…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.49,1:34:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,静静等待{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.03,1:34:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天起你们就要争取自己应得的权利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow, you claim what is rightfully yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.37,1:34:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时按兵不动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull back the fighters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.83,1:34:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,先派出高空侦察机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start high-level reconnaissance flights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.38,1:34:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我联络总统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the president on the line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.69,1:35:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,坦克和飞机都无法阻止我们引爆炸弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tanks and planes cannot stop us from detonating our device.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.78,1:35:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,派一名代表过来谈判补给和通讯的条件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send an emissary to discuss terms of access for supplies and communication.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.96,1:35:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有多少人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many of you are there, son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.67,1:35:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,以你们的人数不可能阻止1200万人离开这个岛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have enough men to stop 12 million people from leaving this island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.26,1:35:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们没办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, we don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.84,1:35:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.64,1:35:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么可能帮你们看守人质？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, why the hell would I try to help you keep your hostages?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.06,1:35:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有一个人走过这座桥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If one person crosses this bridge…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.23,1:35:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,高谭市就会整个爆炸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Gotham gets blown to hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.94,1:35:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,高谭市民拥有坚强的意志{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people of our greatest city are resilient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.82,1:35:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们过去曾展露无遗 未来也不会令大家失望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have proven this before, and they will prove it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.33,1:35:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们绝不和恐怖份子妥协{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not negotiate with terrorists…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.21,1:36:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们必须认清现实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but we do recognize realities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.13,1:36:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论情势如何发展{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As this situation develops…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.76,1:36:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有件事请大家一定要明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…one thing must be understood above all others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.09,1:36:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们绝对不会遗弃高谭市民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}People of Gotham, we have not abandoned you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.18,1:36:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.14,1:36:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思就是我们现在孤立无援了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means we're on our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.93,1:36:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该要发表公开演说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to get in front of a camera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.10,1:36:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 你一露脸 他们就会马上杀了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will kill you the second you show your face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.11,1:36:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝恩说他要把高谭市还给市民 我要让大家知道我能领导他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bane says he's giving Gotham back to the people. They need to know I could lead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.15,1:36:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝恩不可能让你这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bane's not gonna let that happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.90,1:36:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就让他露出真面目{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he'll show his true colors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.61,1:36:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己也会送命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'll be dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.88,1:36:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们后方矗立的 就是高谭市受压迫的象征{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behind you stands a symbol of oppression.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.60,1:36:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑门监狱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blackgate Prison…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.23,1:37:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这监狱里有上千人因为某个人而受尽折磨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…where a thousand men have languished under the name of this man:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.65,1:37:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是哈维·丹特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harvey Dent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.49,1:37:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直被塑造成正义的化身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who has been held up to you as the shining example of justice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.91,1:37:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你发表电视演说前 我们必须协助你藏身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just gonna keep moving you till we can get you in front of the camera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.08,1:37:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直以来你们都拜错了偶像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been supplied with a false idol to stop you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.21,1:37:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,才让这个城市继续腐败下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…tearing down this corrupt city!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.59,1:37:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我向大家揭发哈维·丹特的真面目{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you the truth about Harvey Dent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.38,1:37:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,以下是引述自高谭市警察局长吉姆·高登的讲稿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the words of Gotham's police commissioner James Gordon:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.35,1:37:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,「蝙蝠侠并没有杀害哈维·丹特」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Batman didn't murder Harvey Dent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.85,1:37:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,「他救了我儿子一命」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saved my boy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.98,1:37:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,「还替哈维所犯下的骇人罪行扛起责任」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then took the blame for Harvey's appalling crimes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.57,1:37:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,「好让我能够厚颜无耻地」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…so that I could, to my shame…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.36,1:37:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,「为这位堕落的偶像编造谎言」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…build a lie around this fallen idol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.76,1:38:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,「过去我每年都歌颂这个试图杀害我儿子的狂人」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I praised the madman who tried to murder my own child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.29,1:38:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,「如今我已无法继续忍受自己的谎言」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can no longer live with my lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.21,1:38:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,「现在我将这个事实公诸于世」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is time to trust the people of Gotham with the truth…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.13,1:38:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,「同时辞去我的职务」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and it is time for me to resign."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.18,1:38:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们愿意接受这位仁兄的辞呈吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And do you accept this man's resignation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.31,1:38:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们愿意让那些骗子 那些腐败的官员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And do you accept the resignation of all of these liars?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.69,1:38:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部辞职下台吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of all the corrupt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.15,1:38:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,八年来那么多人被关进黑门监狱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those men locked up for eight years in Blackgate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.57,1:38:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为丹特法案而不得假释 全都建立在一个谎言上？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and denied parole under the Dent Act, it was based on a lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.87,1:38:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时的高谭市需要一个英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotham needed a hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.66,1:38:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,高谭市现在更需要英雄 你背叛了你所捍卫的价值{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it needs it now more than ever, but you betrayed everything you stood for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.79,1:38:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,当一个体制完全背离了人们的信任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a point far out there when the structures fail you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.63,1:38:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,法律不但无用武之地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when the rules aren't weapons anymore…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.22,1:39:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,反而成为枷锁 让坏人为所欲为{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…they're shackles, letting the bad guy get ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.35,1:39:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天 你可能也会面临这样的困境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day, you may face such a moment of crisis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.77,1:39:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候 我希望你也有个像蝙蝠侠那样的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in that moment, I hope you have a friend like I did…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.74,1:39:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,能自愿背黑锅 好让你继续当个不沾锅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to plunge their hands into the filth, so that you can keep yours clean!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.45,1:39:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来你很黑 局长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hands look plenty filthy to me, commissioner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.75,1:39:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拯救高谭市 免于受腐败官吏的摧残{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take Gotham from the corrupt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.54,1:39:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,富人的摧残{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rich!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.55,1:39:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人编造机会的神话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The oppressors of generations…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.67,1:39:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,世世代代压迫着你们小老百姓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who have kept you down with myths of opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.01,1:39:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们把高谭市归还给你们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we give it back to you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.68,1:39:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体市民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.98,1:39:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,高谭市就在你们手里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotham is yours!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.35,1:39:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,无人能够干预 尽情地享受吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}None shall interfere. Do as you please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.24,1:39:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就从推倒黑门监狱开始 释放人犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But start by storming Blackgate and freeing the oppressed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.61,1:40:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.25,1:40:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,向前迈进吧 受刑人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step forward, those who would serve…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.88,1:40:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们将组成一支军队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for an army will be raised.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.88,1:40:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,把特权人士从他们的安乐窝里拖出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The powerful will be ripped from their decadent nests…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.18,1:40:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢进冷酷世界里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and cast out into the cold world that we know and endure!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.28,1:40:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们将接受法院审判{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Courts will be convened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.04,1:40:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽情蹂躏他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spoils will be enjoyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.13,1:40:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们血流成河{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood will be shed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.09,1:41:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察可以留下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police will survive…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.93,1:41:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们必须先学会维持真正的正义{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as they learn to serve true justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.47,1:41:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个伟大的城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This great city…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.15,1:41:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须咬紧牙关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it will endure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.36,1:41:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,高谭市才能更长久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotham will survive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.53,1:41:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说你得先治好你的背{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says you must first fix your back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.59,1:41:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么知道？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does he know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.89,1:41:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以前是个狱医{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was the prison doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.47,1:41:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,染上了吗啡毒瘾 不过他在这里救治了很多人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a morphine addict who incurred the displeasure…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.52,1:41:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括你那戴面罩的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of powerful people, including your masked friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.36,1:41:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么一回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.11,1:42:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前 那个瘟疫的年代{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many years ago, it was a time of plague.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.99,1:42:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一群囚犯攻击贝恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of the other prisoners attacked Bane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.12,1:42:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位医生尽力帮他治疗伤口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doctor's fumbling attempts to repair the damage…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.58,1:42:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还是留下了永久的疼痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…left him in perpetual agony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.38,1:42:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是他用面罩来帮他止痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mask holds the pain at bay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.71,1:42:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝恩就是那个逃出去的孩子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bane was the child you spoke of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.22,1:42:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这里出生的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was born here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.47,1:42:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说有一个佣兵 他效力于一个本地军阀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The legend is that there was a mercenary who worked for a local warlord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.68,1:42:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他爱上了军阀的女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He fell in love with the warlord's daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.52,1:42:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们秘密结婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were married in secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.27,1:42:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但后来被军阀发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the warlord found out…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.77,1:42:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个佣兵被关进这个地牢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the mercenary was condemned to this pit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.19,1:42:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但后来又被流放{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then he exiled him instead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.61,1:42:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他大概猜想是军阀的女儿帮他求情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mercenary understood that it was the daughter who had secured his release.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.83,1:42:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他不知道自由背后的真正代价{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what he could not know was the true price of his freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.75,1:42:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她代替他关进这座地牢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took his place in the pit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.67,1:43:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时还怀着孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she was with child…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.38,1:43:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那佣兵的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the mercenary's child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.88,1:43:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,阴暗的地底是不可能绽放出纯真的花朵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Innocence cannot flower underground. It has to be stamped out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.72,1:43:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天医生忘了帮她锁上牢房{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day, the doctor forgot to lock the cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.44,1:43:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好那个孩子有个朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the child had a friend…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.24,1:43:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的守护者 他极力保护那纯真的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a protector who showed the others that this innocence was their redemption.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.87,1:43:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子的母亲就没那么幸运了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was to be prized. The mother was not so lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.67,1:43:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这里是贝恩的监狱 不能再讲下去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Bane's prison now. He wouldn't want this story told.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.72,1:43:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你背上有一节脊椎突出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a vertebra protruding from your back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.81,1:44:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,要把它弄回去才行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to be put back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.90,1:44:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,维持这个姿势 直到你站起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay like this until you stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.00,1:44:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想过我会回来吧 布鲁斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tsk, tsk, tsk. Did you not think I would return, Bruce? Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.30,1:44:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过我是永生的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you I was immortal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.47,1:44:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲眼…亲眼看到你死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I watched… I watched you die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.76,1:44:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,永生的形式有很多种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there are many forms of immortality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.64,1:44:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经有一个妻子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once, I had a wife…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.65,1:44:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的挚爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…my great love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.73,1:44:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她被人从我身边带走了 - 你就是那个佣兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She was taken from me. - You were the mercenary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.16,1:44:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝恩是你的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bane is your child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.74,1:44:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的继承人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your heir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.95,1:45:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们影武者联盟是来恢复文明平衡的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An heir to ensure the League of Shadows fulfills its duty to restore balance to civilization.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.67,1:45:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.88,1:45:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多年来 你对抗高谭市的邪恶势力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You yourself fought the decadence of Gotham for years…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.46,1:45:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,耗尽你的意志…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with all your strength…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.76,1:45:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的资源 你的信念{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…all your resources, all your moral authority.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.72,1:45:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你仅存的胜利却是一个谎言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the only victory you could achieve was a lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.35,1:45:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你明白了吧？高谭市已无可救药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you understand. Gotham is beyond saving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.39,1:45:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.69,1:45:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个城市必须毁灭 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And must be allowed to die. - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.74,1:45:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,抬起你的头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, just lift your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.16,1:45:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.41,1:45:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要扶我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.83,1:46:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么？ - 某个人的家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that? - This was someone's home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.33,1:46:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这里是属于每一个人的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now it's everyone's home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.04,1:46:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,风暴来袭 对吧？这是我们梦寐以求的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a storm coming, remember? This is what you wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.20,1:46:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是给巴士用的 说不定哪天有幸能够撤离{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for the bus, in case there's a chance to evacuate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.16,1:47:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有局长的消息吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any news? Is the commissioner…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.87,1:47:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要知道比较好 孩子们还好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The less you know, Father. How are the boys doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.37,1:47:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在电力比较充足 有时还可以看电视{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we've had more power on, so they've got some TV.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.33,1:47:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.38,1:47:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱克 小心点 警察现在都成了落水狗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blake, you be careful out there. They're hunting down cops like dogs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.14,1:47:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛要锻炼身体？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why build yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.77,1:47:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不想死在这里面 - 反正终究难逃一死 有什么差别？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not meant to die in here. - Here, there. What's the difference?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.46,1:48:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过那是不可能的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you it could not be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.96,1:48:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说有个孩子成功逃出去过？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me a child did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.96,1:48:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是普通的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But no ordinary child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.42,1:48:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是生于地狱的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A child born in hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.56,1:48:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在苦难中成长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forged from suffering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.14,1:48:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在悲痛里茁壮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardened by pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.98,1:48:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是像你这种来自优越环境的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a man from privilege.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.67,1:49:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经暗中派人过去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got boots on the ground, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.42,1:49:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就等消息{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just waiting on intel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.22,1:49:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有证件吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have ID?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.97,1:49:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.18,1:49:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我们要如何相信你？ - 我们别无选择了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, how can we trust you? - We don't have any choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.60,1:49:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,高登局长 我是特种部队的琼丝上尉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commissioner Gordon. Captain Jones, Special Forces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.10,1:49:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你们前来支援{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain. Glad to have you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.81,1:49:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的职责 你们有多少警力？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our job, sir. Now, uh, how many of you are there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.65,1:49:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,几十人 没有仔细算{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's dozens. I'd rather not say exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.74,1:49:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是困在地底下的有将近三千人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the men trapped underground number almost 3000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.16,1:49:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们目前情况如何？ - 有送食物和水进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Condition? - Getting food and water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.24,1:49:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有办法把他们救出来吗？ - 可以 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can we break them out? - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.70,1:49:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要解决掉公园南端出水口的卫兵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take out the mercenaries south of Ackerman Park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.21,1:49:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以炸开一个供10人通行的大洞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blow the rubble, make a hole big enough for 10 at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.08,1:49:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直和地底下的同事保持联系 他们已经准备周全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in contact with my partner who's down there. They're just waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.46,1:50:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都三个月没见过阳光了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men who haven't seen daylight in three months?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.45,1:50:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个月没见过阳光 但仍是警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officers who haven't seen daylight in three months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.88,1:50:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹要怎么办？卫星侦测不到辐射点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the bomb? Satellite can't pick up radiation hot spots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.09,1:50:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把炸弹放在卡车内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They keep it on a truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.49,1:50:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是用内衬铅线的屋顶遮蔽起来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must have a lead-lined roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.64,1:50:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那辆卡车持续地移动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They move it constantly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.73,1:50:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 所以你们知道是哪一辆卡车？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. So you know the truck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.48,1:50:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前只知道是三辆中的一辆 已经追踪好一阵子了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's one of three. We've been tracking it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.19,1:50:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,空的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decoy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.77,1:50:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你该不会以为蝙蝠侠回来吧？ - 我怎么想并不重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't really think he's coming back? - Doesn't matter what I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.36,1:50:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会不重要？你应该把希望寄托在更实际的事物上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, it does. You should put your faith in something a little more real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.41,1:50:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 路线似乎变化不大 - 找到引爆者的身份了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The routes don't vary much. - Okay. What about the triggerman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.78,1:50:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没线索 应该是唬人的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No leads. It's a bluff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.87,1:50:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝恩不可能把炸弹的控制权交给别人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bane wouldn't give control of that bomb to someone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.00,1:50:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能冒这个险 在找出引爆者之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't take that chance. Until we have the triggerman, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.44,1:50:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只需追踪炸弹的下落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we just track the device.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.38,1:50:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这段期间就任凭高谭市被蹂躏？陷入无政府状态？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And meanwhile, Gotham lives under a warlord, like some failed state?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.46,1:50:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,请收回你说的话 这种情况是史无前例的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dial it back, officer. This situation is unprecedented.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.51,1:50:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能拿一千多万人的生命当赌注{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't do anything to risk millions of lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.10,1:50:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算向大家报告实情吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna tell him what's really going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.93,1:50:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,上尉 这事态比你想象中的复杂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, the situation is more complicated than you think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.18,1:50:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们带你去见一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's someone you need to meet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.73,1:51:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这里寻找制高点的时候 发现那家公司的经营人躲在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Came upstairs looking for a vantage point. Found the people who run the corporation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.77,1:51:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪家公司？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What corporation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.11,1:51:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦恩企业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wayne Enterprises. You good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.54,1:51:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,福克斯先生 麻烦你跟上尉做个简短的报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Fox, would you like to brief the captain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.91,1:51:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,让泰特小姐说明就可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Tate's fully aware of the situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.67,1:51:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是韦恩企业的总裁 这次的事件我们责无旁贷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as CEO of Wayne Enterprises, I have to take responsibility for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.30,1:51:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？ - 因为那是我们制作的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - We built it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.47,1:51:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹是你们做的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You built the bomb?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.13,1:51:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们制作的是核融合反应器 前所未见的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was built as a fusion reactor. First of its kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.47,1:51:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝恩把核心改造成炸弹 并且把它从反应器中卸下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bane turned the core into a bomb and removed it from the reactor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.02,1:51:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要说到重点了 - 随着这个装置的燃料电池劣化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here's the important part. - As the device's fuel cells deteriorate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.56,1:51:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会逐渐变得不稳定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it becomes increasingly unstable…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.65,1:51:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后就会爆炸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to the point of detonation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.36,1:51:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这炸弹是个定时炸弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This bomb is a time bomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.27,1:51:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,23天后就会爆炸 不论贝恩的革命如何进行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it will go off in 23 days, regardless of Bane's revolution…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.88,1:51:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论我们或外界怎么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or what we, or the outside world, choose to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.32,1:51:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的和平计划可能不如想象中的实际{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So your plan might not be as practical as you thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.45,1:51:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们能解除炸弹吗？ - 必须把它接回反应器 使它稳定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Could you disarm it? - I could reconnect it to the reactor. Stabilize it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.08,1:52:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们先离开这个地方再去报告 - 好 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's move from this location and call it in. - Right. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.38,1:52:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里由我们接手就可以了 你留下来照顾这些人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, we'll take it from here. You stay and look after these folks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.93,1:52:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被出卖了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone sold us out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.58,1:52:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死也不会说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll die before I talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.37,1:52:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这样如何 上尉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on your schedule, captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.09,1:52:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼上有住人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were people living upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.93,1:52:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,通通抓去接受审判{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Round them up for judgment…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.89,1:53:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这三个人吊起来 展示给全世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and hang them where the world can see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.50,1:53:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 那个关键的跳跃 重要的不是体能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says the leap to freedom is not about strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.00,1:53:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有体能 我才跳得过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My body makes the jump.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.46,1:53:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,求生是一种是精神 是灵魂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survival is the spirit. The soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.26,1:53:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的灵魂已经准备好要逃出去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My soul is as ready to escape as my body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.39,1:53:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉到恐惧吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear is why you fail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.68,1:53:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我一点都不害怕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.89,1:53:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是愤怒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm angry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.63,1:54:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.30,1:54:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么会跌倒？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do we fall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.43,1:54:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不畏惧死亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not fear death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.35,1:54:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为这样会使你更坚强？其实只会使你软弱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this makes you strong. It makes you weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.44,1:54:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.65,1:54:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又如何能够超越自己的速度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you move faster than possible…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.20,1:54:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,超越自己的战斗力？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…fight longer than possible…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.95,1:54:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是你内心缺少那股最强的动力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…without the most powerful impulse of the spirit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.79,1:54:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对死亡的恐惧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fear of death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:44.12,1:54:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我其实是畏惧死亡的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do fear death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.79,1:54:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害怕会死在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear dying in here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.55,1:54:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,担心我的城市被火焰吞噬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…while my city burns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.51,1:54:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,却没人拯救它…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no one there to save it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.80,1:54:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就爬出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then make the climb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.35,1:55:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,要怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.19,1:55:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,像那个孩子一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the child did…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.69,1:55:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要绑绳子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…without the rope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.03,1:55:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,让恐惧成为你的翅膀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then fear will find you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.33,1:55:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是出乎意料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, supplies for your journey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.75,1:55:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's wonderful. That's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.38,1:55:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.55,1:55:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,崛起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.14,1:55:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.14,1:57:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们抓错人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there's been a mistake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:13.23,1:57:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我去见贝恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me to Bane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.82,1:57:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝恩在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to see Bane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:22.74,1:57:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,肃静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Order!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:23.99,1:57:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要见贝恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a mistake! Where is Bane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.91,1:57:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有抓错人 史戴佛先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been no mistake, Mr. Stryver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.41,1:57:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是菲利浦·史戴佛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are Philip Stryver…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:32.00,1:57:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,达格工业的副总裁 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…executive vice president of Daggett Industries…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.67,1:57:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这些年来靠着压榨平民百姓血汗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who for years has been living off the blood and sweat…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:39.46,1:57:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,享尽荣华富贵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of people less powerful than him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.84,1:57:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,打电话给贝恩 我跟你们是一伙的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call Bane. I am one of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.18,1:57:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不受贝恩指挥 这里只是判刑听证会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bane has no authority here. This is merely a sentencing hearing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:48.89,1:57:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好 你可以选择{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the choice is yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.18,1:57:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,放逐或是死刑？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exile or death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:58.23,1:57:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,肃静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Order!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.23,1:58:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,放逐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exi… Exile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.28,1:58:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,判刑确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.86,1:58:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷汗先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the man in the cold sweat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:13.00,1:58:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,沿着厚一点的冰层前进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You follow the thick ice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.58,1:58:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,若是掉进水里 不消几分钟就会冻死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You try to swim, you're dead in minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.88,1:58:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人成功过吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has anyone made it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.89,1:58:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在哪儿？我们快没时间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they? It's not like we have a lot of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:34.77,1:58:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有多久？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:36.06,1:58:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹明天就会爆炸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bomb goes off tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.31,1:58:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只剩18个小时可用 - 该怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have about 18 hours to do something. - To do what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.48,1:58:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,先把GPS装置放到那辆卡车上 再思考如何把炸弹弄下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To mark the truck. Get a GPS on it so we can start to figure out how to bring it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.20,1:58:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩这些人？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.96,1:58:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Foley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.58,1:59:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 佛利去哪了？ - 你最好不要去街上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Foley, damn it? - You shouldn't be out on the streets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.22,1:59:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吉姆 他不在家 - 在这个城市生死存亡的关键时刻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jim, he's not here. - You let your wife come to the door?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.30,1:59:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还躲在老婆背后？ - 在厨房里等着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When the city's under occupation? - Wait in the kitchen, honey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:13.52,1:59:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回家做什么？把警察制服埋起来吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do, bury your uniform in the backyard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.31,1:59:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也看到他们如何对付那几个特种部队的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw what they did to those Special Forces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.60,1:59:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得我们以前当巡逻警察的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you forgotten all the years we were out on patrol?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.11,1:59:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心里明白那些暴徒是有多么凶残了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When every gangbanger wanted to plant one as soon as our backs were turned?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.40,1:59:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在情况不同 这帮人掌控整个城市 连政府都默许{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was different. These guys run the city. The government's done a deal with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:28.70,1:59:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是拿贝恩没辙 并没有默许{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bane's got their balls in a vice. That's not a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.41,1:59:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你如果对贝恩采取行动 引爆者就会按下开关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You move on Bane, the triggerman is gonna hit the button.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.87,1:59:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他有可能把炸弹的控制权交给其他人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think he's given control of that bomb to one of the people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.00,1:59:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为他们在搞革命？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this is part of some revolution?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.17,1:59:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个人可以控制炸弹 就是贝恩自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's one man with his finger on the button. That's Bane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.17,1:59:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 我们最好躲紧一点 等候政府解决一切问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we've all got to keep our heads down till they can fix this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:47.43,1:59:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果你家人还住这里 - 这件事只能靠我们自己解决{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If you still had a family here… - This only gets fixed from inside the city!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.14,1:59:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 皮特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.77,1:59:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是要求你要成就什么辉煌的事迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not asking you to walk down Grand in your dress blues, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.65,2:00:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是总得有人出来做点事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but something has to be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.52,2:00:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 吉姆 - 躲紧一点？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, Jim. I gotta… - Keep your head down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:02.73,2:00:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天炸弹爆炸的时候 你要躲到哪里去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What good's that gonna do when that thing blows?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:05.07,2:00:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不知道炸弹会不会爆炸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know that's gonna happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:11.70,2:00:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你需要人手 局长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you're looking for men, commissioner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:14.16,2:00:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来帮忙吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about me instead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:15.58,2:00:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰特小姐 我不能让你身陷危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Tate, I, uh, can't ask you to do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.12,2:00:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.75,2:00:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个小流氓 你拿了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You little punk! What'd you take?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.09,2:00:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么也没拿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing! I didn't take anything!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.55,2:00:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,敢偷我们的东西？你这小混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You steal from us, you little bastard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.43,2:00:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了 不准你们在我的地盘撒野{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you boys know you can't come into my neighborhood without asking politely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.35,2:00:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 下次偷东西不要挑这种跑得比你快的对象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never steal anything from someone you can't outrun, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:50.28,2:00:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是一个很慷慨的小偷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pretty generous for a thief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:01.00,2:01:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以为他们已经杀了你 - 还没呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought they killed you. - Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.09,2:01:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果你是来要我道歉… - 我不会控诉你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If you're expecting an apology, I… - It wouldn't suit you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.67,2:01:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来找你帮忙的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:10.26,2:01:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你有什么好处？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why would I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:11.88,2:01:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个「洗底」软件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For this. Clean slate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:14.05,2:01:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你放心把那个交给我吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd trust me with that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.64,2:01:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把你害得那么惨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After what I did to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.43,2:01:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我承认当时是有一点失望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll admit, I was a little let down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:22.98,2:01:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我认为你没那么坏 其实 对你而言…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I still think there's more to you. In fact, I think that for you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:26.52,2:01:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,…这只是一个工具{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…this isn't just a tool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:28.03,2:01:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想利用它来洗刷前科 重新做人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an escape route. You want to disappear. Start fresh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:32.15,2:01:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 反正我也逃不出这座岛了 - 我可以帮你逃出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't even get off this island. - I can give you a way off…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:35.28,2:01:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你能帮我找到卢修斯·福克斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…once you get me to Lucius Fox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.99,2:01:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去帮我调查他被关在哪里 然后把我弄进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find out where they're holding him and take me in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.54,2:01:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找福克斯要做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you need Fox?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:44.79,2:01:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拯救高谭市 - 谁要你拯救了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To save the city. - Who says it needs saving?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:47.46,2:01:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就喜欢这样的高谭市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I like it this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:49.21,2:01:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你很喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you do…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:52.22,2:01:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那炸弹明天就会爆炸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but tomorrow that bomb's going off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:57.14,2:01:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又要找你那个厉害的朋友出马吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got your powerful friend on the case?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:59.02,2:02:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:01.18,2:02:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我需要福克斯帮我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I need Fox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:02.98,2:02:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,它靠近的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As it approaches…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:05.52,2:02:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就扳这个开关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…flip the switch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:06.86,2:02:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,指针超过200就发信号给我 我来标记那辆卡车 没问题吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The needle hits 200, you give me the signal, I'll mark the truck. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:11.78,2:02:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,警戒！警戒！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up, heads up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.50,2:02:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我完成了 - 有卫兵朝你们过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got it. - Mercenaries on your 6.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.96,2:02:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准动！把手举起来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand still! Keep your hands where we can see them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:37.30,2:02:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,高登局长 你被捕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commissioner Gordon, you are under arrest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:39.51,2:02:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁授权你们这么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On whose authority?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:41.39,2:02:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,高谭市的市民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people of Gotham.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.60,2:02:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有律师？没有证人？这根本不是正当法律程序{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No lawyer? No witnesses? What sort of due process is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.69,2:02:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们已经定罪了 现在只是判刑听证会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your guilt has been determined, this is merely a sentencing hearing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:52.32,2:02:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要选哪一个？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what will it be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:55.11,2:02:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,死刑还是放逐？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death or exile?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.99,2:03:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱恩 如果你以为我们会心甘情愿地走到那冰上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crane, if you think we're going out onto that ice willingly…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:02.91,2:03:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脑袋一定有问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you have another thing coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.00,2:03:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是死刑啰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.50,2:03:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还不都一样 - 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Looks that way. - Very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:10.88,2:03:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,判处死刑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:13.71,2:03:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,以放逐的方式执行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…by exile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:18.01,2:03:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她带过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring her to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:25.98,2:03:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动要开始了 布莱克说他们已准备好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we're going now. Blake says they're ready! Get your gear on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:30.36,2:03:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,都听清了吗？行动要开始了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you hear me? We're going now. Let's do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.53,2:03:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人被我们逮个正着 明天有好戏看了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find this one a spot, got a big day tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:39.95,2:03:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是每天都抓得到布鲁斯·韦恩呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all do. It's not every day you bag Bruce Wayne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.37,2:03:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布鲁斯 - 你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bruce. - You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:46.91,2:03:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去度假挑的真不是时候 韦恩先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Picked a hell of a time to go on vacation, Mr. Wayne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.46,2:03:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,核心还有多久会点燃？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long until that core ignites?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:51.29,2:03:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 12个钟头后会爆炸 - 我们得在那之前把它接回反应器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That bomb goes off in 12 hours. - Unless we can reconnect it to the reactor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.88,2:03:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可以把米兰达救出去吗？ - 今晚不行 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you get Miranda out of here? - Not tonight. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.80,2:04:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尽力做你们该做的 - 今晚我需要你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do what's necessary. - Tonight I need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:02.22,2:04:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要做什么？ - 帮助我重回战局{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What for? - To get me back in the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:04.81,2:04:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉扫大家的兴了 他们要我把这些人带走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to spoil things, boys, but Bane wants these guys to himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:11.31,2:04:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不会忘记你的 米兰达 - 我懂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I won't forget about you, Miranda. - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:23.70,2:04:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的新女友 韦恩先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like your girlfriend, Mr. Wayne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:25.66,2:04:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没那么幸运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He should be so lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:33.25,2:04:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我对贝恩采取行动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any move I make on Bane or the bomb…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:36.17,2:04:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,引爆者就会让炸弹爆炸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the triggerman sets it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:38.22,2:04:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该不是无线电或移动电话信号 太容易被干扰了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they won't use radio or cell. Too much interference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:41.18,2:04:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,红外线的距离也没那么远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Infrared doesn't have the range.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:43.01,2:04:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是微爆信号 长波{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll have to be a microburst. Longwave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:45.93,2:04:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有办法阻断吗？ - 可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Could you block it? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:47.89,2:04:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我需要用到蝙蝠战机上的EMP飞弹制导系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll need the EMP cannon guidance mount from the Bat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:52.69,2:04:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得你停在哪里吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember where you parked?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:08.70,2:05:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好开吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She fly okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:11.21,2:05:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不错 虽然没有自动驾驶系统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, even without the autopilot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:14.08,2:05:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多谢啦 - 自动驾驶？那还需要你做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks. - Autopilot? That's what you're there for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:56.79,2:05:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人了 快上来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. It's clear. Come on, quick. One at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.51,2:06:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.18,2:06:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ross!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:07.81,2:06:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ross?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:09.81,2:06:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那里锁起来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:12.56,2:06:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,卧倒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:15.77,2:06:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:46.43,2:06:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,点火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Light it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.70,2:07:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 你看 - 亲爱的 快来看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad, check it out. - Honey, come take a look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.25,2:07:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:21.75,2:07:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她看紧一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep her close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:24.17,2:07:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会来救她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll come for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:26.18,2:07:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,米兰达·泰特在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Miranda Tate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:28.59,2:07:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝恩把她带走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bane took her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:30.26,2:07:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他占领了市政厅 周围都有他的军队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's holed up at city hall, surrounded by his army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:33.85,2:07:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个可以阻断引爆器发送给炸弹的信号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This blocks the remote detonator signal to the bomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:36.52,2:07:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,日出之前把它装上去 我发动的时候 引爆者可能会按下按钮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it onto it before sunrise. They might hit the button when it starts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:41.11,2:07:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,发动什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When what starts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:42.78,2:07:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}War.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:19.85,2:08:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你漏掉了一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You missed a spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.57,2:08:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要单枪匹马 记得带面具{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're working alone, wear a mask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:27.54,2:08:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不怕人家知道我站出来抵抗恶势力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not afraid to be seen standing up to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:29.61,2:08:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,面具不是要保护你 而是要保护你所爱的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mask is not for you. It's to protect the people you care about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:34.54,2:08:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,数到五 丢出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Count to five, then throw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:46.88,2:08:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,无意冒犯 你有没有火力强一点的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense, but you got something bigger in that belt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:59.98,2:09:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 接下来怎么做？ - 全力攻击贝恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What now? - All-out assault on Bane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:03.27,2:09:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要你带领民众过桥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you need to get people across the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:05.69,2:09:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？ - 万一我们失败了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - In case we fail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:08.11,2:09:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要留个后路 尽你所能多救一些人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lead an exodus. Save as many lives as you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:10.99,2:09:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要我留下来帮忙吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need me here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.45,2:09:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经给我一支军队了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've given me an army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:14.16,2:09:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:16.08,2:09:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:17.33,2:09:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用这么早谢我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't thank me yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:18.83,2:09:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不谢 说不定就没机会了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I might not get a chance later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:34.72,2:09:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.39,2:09:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,主要隧道被碎石堵住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The midtown tunnel's blocked by debris…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:39.73,2:09:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我用炮弹打开一条通道供民众通行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but the cannons have enough firepower to make a path for people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:43.27,2:09:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,等战争开打的时候再动手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait until the fighting begins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:45.27,2:09:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是为了救你女朋友才开战的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna wage a war to save your stuck-up girlfriend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:48.15,2:09:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,发动 油门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To start it, throttle…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:50.99,2:09:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我懂啦 - 我们还剩45分钟来拯救这个城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got it. - We have 45 minutes to save this city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:54.32,2:09:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 我还剩45分钟来逃离爆炸半径{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I've got 45 minutes to get clear of the blast radius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:57.24,2:10:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这场战争你根本毫无胜算 - 如果你愿意帮忙 我或许能成功{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't stand a chance against these guys. - With your help, I might.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:00.70,2:10:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮你打通隧道 然后就走人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll open that tunnel, then I'm gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:04.17,2:10:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是那样的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more to you than that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:09.42,2:10:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉我总是让你失望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to keep letting you down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:15.18,2:10:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我一起走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:18.01,2:10:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,救你自己一命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:21.85,2:10:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对这些人不再有所亏欠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't owe these people any more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:24.73,2:10:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已为他们奉献出了一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've given them everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:27.02,2:10:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:28.90,2:10:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不够{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:10.19,2:11:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点解散{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disperse!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:12.03,2:11:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就开火了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disperse or be fired upon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:15.65,2:11:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们才是这个城市的正牌警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one police in this town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:11:57.03,2:11:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:49.92,2:12:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来了 - 预备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here it comes! - Get ready!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:21.49,2:13:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是回来这里陪葬的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you came back to die with your city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:25.91,2:13:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是来制止你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I came back to stop you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:40.76,2:13:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:54.73,2:13:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:58.23,2:13:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,去第五街{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut over to Fifth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:13.92,2:14:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上巴士 快去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go. Get on the bus. Go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:16.08,2:14:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我来 你也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, come with me. You too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:18.88,2:14:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你 你 到这边来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you, you, and you, come here, come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:22.09,2:14:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人全部上车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone else get on the bus, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:24.09,2:14:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们几个去挨家挨户敲门 告诉大家炸弹要爆炸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys, you go knock on doors and spread the word, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:26.93,2:14:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫大家从南街的隧道逃走 或是过桥逃走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bomb is gonna go off. Get out by the South Street tunnel or over the bridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:30.97,2:14:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,走两个街区就回到巴士上 听懂了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do two blocks and you get back to the bus, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:33.85,2:14:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:35.90,2:14:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他回来了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:38.65,2:14:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 快去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your eyes open. Go, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:02.61,2:16:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,守住门口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover the doors!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:07.32,2:16:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,引爆器在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your trigger?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:09.20,2:16:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:11.74,2:16:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本没把引爆器交给别人 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd never give it to an ordinary citizen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:14.74,2:16:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,引爆器在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it? Where's your trigger?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:18.75,2:16:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?! Where is it?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:29.26,2:16:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我引爆器在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me where the trigger is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:31.89,2:16:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 我就让你领死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you have my permission to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:47.61,2:16:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明明打断了你的背{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I broke you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:50.61,2:16:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么回来这里的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How have you come back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:52.66,2:16:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为只有你有那个本事逃出来吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're the only one who could learn the strength to escape?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:57.33,2:16:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,引爆器在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the trigger?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:59.29,2:17:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没逃出来过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I never escaped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:02.50,2:17:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那个孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:05.84,2:17:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,忍者大师的孩子不是逃出来了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The child of Ra's Al Ghul made the climb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:08.05,2:17:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是忍者大师的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's not the child of Ra's Al Ghul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:14.35,2:17:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:16.14,2:17:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我不是普通人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And though I'm not ordinary…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:19.89,2:17:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我也是本市的市民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I am a citizen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:41.21,2:17:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,米兰达{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miranda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:45.25,2:17:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:47.05,2:17:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔莉亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:49.21,2:17:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我母亲去世前给我取的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother named me Talia, before she was killed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:53.09,2:17:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,若不是贝恩守护我 我早就和我母亲一起死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the way I would have been killed, if not for my protector Bane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:05.98,2:18:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,永别了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:09.40,2:18:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我逃出来后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I climbed out of the pit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:17.49,2:18:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到我的父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found my father…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:22.25,2:18:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他回去复仇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and brought him back to exact terrible vengeance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:26.25,2:18:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是迟了一步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But by that time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:29.13,2:18:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,囚犯和狱医对我的守护者做了可怕的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the prisoners and doctor had done their work to my friend. My protector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:38.26,2:18:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们接受影武者联盟的训练{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The League took us in. Trained us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:42.06,2:18:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我父亲不接收贝恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my father could not accept Bane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:45.40,2:18:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他视贝恩为怪物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saw only a monster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:47.31,2:18:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他忘不了自己的妻子在那人间炼狱中惨死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His very existence was a reminder of the hell he'd left his wife to die in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:53.61,2:18:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他把贝恩逐出了影武者联盟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He excommunicated Bane from the League of Shadows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:56.91,2:19:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他唯一犯的错就是他爱我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His only crime was that he loved me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:03.25,2:19:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原本无法原谅我父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could not forgive my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:10.80,2:19:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到你杀死了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until you murdered him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:30.32,2:19:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他试图杀害上千万的无辜民众{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was trying to kill millions of innocent people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:36.07,2:19:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,高谭市的市民配不上「无辜」二字 布鲁斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Innocent is a strong word to throw around Gotham, Bruce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:42.33,2:19:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要完成我父亲的遗愿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I honor my father by finishing his work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:57.55,2:20:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了报杀父之仇 我耐心等候了这么多年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vengeance against the man who killed him is simply a reward for my patience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:03.93,2:20:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:06.56,2:20:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那把慢慢琢磨的刀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it's the slow knife…the knife that takes its time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:14.48,2:20:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那把静静等候却未曾遗忘的刀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The knife that waits years without forgetting…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:20.41,2:20:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能锥心刺骨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then slips quietly between the bones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:24.74,2:20:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能让你痛彻心扉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the knife that cuts deepest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:28.87,2:20:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:37.72,2:20:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的刀可能磨得太慢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe your knife was too slow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:42.30,2:20:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人攻击卡车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truck is under attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:43.89,2:20:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,高登？是你教他阻断引爆器的信号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gordon. You gave him a way to block my signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:47.81,2:20:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:51.40,2:20:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是帮高谭市多争取11分钟的时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's bought Gotham 11 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:57.86,2:20:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:20:59.99,2:21:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:07.00,2:21:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准动 你在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay there! What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:09.87,2:21:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是布莱克警探 我要带大家去安全的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blake, MCU! I'm getting these boys to safety!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:13.38,2:21:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会害死所有人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get us all killed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:14.88,2:21:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有人走过这座桥 贝恩就会把高谭市炸掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anyone crosses this bridge, they'll blow the city!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:18.05,2:21:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正炸弹快爆炸了 请你们立刻开放这座桥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna blow anyway! We need to open this bridge, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:21.59,2:21:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你往前一步 我们就对你开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detective, if you take one step forward we will shoot you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:24.93,2:21:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你往前两步 我们就炸断这座桥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you take two steps forward, we will blow the bridge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:30.60,2:21:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,先回车上等我好吗？回车上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, go back by the bus and wait for me, all right? Go back and wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:37.15,2:21:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,去准备护送部队 在爆炸之前 我们一定要把炸弹看好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare a convoy. We must secure the bomb until it detonates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:42.45,2:21:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要杀他 让他亲身感受那股炙热{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't kill him, I want him to feel the heat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:46.91,2:21:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,1200万灵魂燃烧的火焰 你失败了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel the fire of 12 million souls. You failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:21:57.71,2:21:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,永别了 我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:07.35,2:22:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,永别了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:09.27,2:22:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续前进 把他们逼向台阶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving forward! Flank them at the stairs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:20.99,2:22:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,扫射{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:23.40,2:22:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,通通杀掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:34.08,2:22:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该心知肚明 我现在就要把你解决掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both know that I have to kill you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:40.63,2:22:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只好请你自己想象那股炙热的火焰了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll just have to imagine the fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:50.68,2:22:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于那个「不准开枪」的原则…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the whole no-guns thing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:53.69,2:22:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我实在没办法像你有那么坚定的信念{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm not sure I feel as strongly about it as you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:10.12,2:23:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,开到它旁边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:14.46,2:23:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持这个位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay level.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:28.26,2:23:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须逼他们把卡车开往反应器的入口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to force that convoy east to the entrance to the reactor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:33.39,2:23:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从地面上进行 我也会过去 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you on the ground, I'll be in the air. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:36.64,2:23:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,情势有所改变 先前的命令已经不适用了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The situation has changed. Your orders are out of date.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:40.61,2:23:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你们一样都是警察 现在我要走过去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a cop, like you, and I'm walking out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:44.90,2:23:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要对我开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please do not shoot me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:48.95,2:23:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,打他的脚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot at his feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:00.08,2:24:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有什么比空中优势更棒的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing like a little air superiority.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:02.59,2:24:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,警探 请止步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detective! Please stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:05.26,2:24:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 停下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, detective! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:08.51,2:24:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop walking!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:11.22,2:24:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,把桥炸断 炸掉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blow it! Do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:25.23,2:24:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要把炸弹带过来这里 还剩十分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to get that bomb here. You've got 10 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:38.58,2:24:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正把我们逼向反应器的入口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're pushing us to the entrance of the reactor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:41.04,2:24:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,想把核心重新接回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna try to reconnect the core.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:44.80,2:24:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个大笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You idiots!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:46.63,2:24:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个王八蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sons of bitches!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:48.59,2:24:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都要被你害死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're killing us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:50.51,2:24:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,只会死守命令{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, follow your orders!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:52.51,2:24:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 孩子们 大家手牵手围个圆圈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, boys. Get in a circle. Bow your heads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:57.73,2:24:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他撑不了多久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's on my side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:47.48,2:25:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家回车上坐好 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Father! Let's get everyone back on the bus, okay? Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:50.78,2:25:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都回车上 - 我们已经无处可逃了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Back on the bus! - There's nowhere to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:54.49,2:25:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the bus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:52.42,2:26:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要把卡车逼向东边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to turn the truck east!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:59.47,2:27:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要转弯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay straight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:32.96,2:27:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来帮我 我们在上面绑一条绳索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a hand! We can get a cable on it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:43.10,2:27:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,福克斯有教我如何修改反应器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fox showed me how to override the reactor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:49.69,2:27:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:54.65,2:27:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括紧急洪水的设定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Including the emergency flood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:14.38,2:28:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不可能阻止炸弹爆炸的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way this bomb will be stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:22.10,2:28:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:23.39,2:28:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,做好爆炸气流的防护 大家不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protection from the blast. We're gonna be all right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:25.93,2:28:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是原子弹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an atom bomb!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:27.39,2:28:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想看着大家抱憾而死吗？快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think they need to hear that? Let them die without hope? Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:30.98,2:28:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备受死吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare yourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:34.36,2:28:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经完成了我父亲的遗愿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father's work is done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:45.12,2:28:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要做什么？ - 我可以把它带到海上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - I can get it out over the bay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:48.50,2:28:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以设定飞到海上然后就跳机吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set it to fly out over the water, then eject?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:50.88,2:28:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有自动驾驶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No autopilot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:54.13,2:28:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本来可以一走了之 但你却选择回来这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could've gone anywhere, been anything. But you came back here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:57.67,2:28:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So did you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:59.26,2:29:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这两个大傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we're both suckers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:08.98,2:29:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我本来不想问你的真实身份 - 很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I never cared who you were. - And you were right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:11.98,2:29:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是人们有权知道谁是拯救他们的英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't the people know the hero who saved them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:14.73,2:29:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人都可以是英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hero can be anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:16.07,2:29:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕只是做一个简单的举动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even a man doing something as simple and reassuring…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:19.15,2:29:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,为无助的小男孩披上外套 让他知道…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as putting a coat around a young boy's shoulders to let him know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:23.20,2:29:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,人生还可以继续下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the world hadn't ended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:42.72,2:29:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯·韦恩？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce Wayne?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:29:57.27,2:30:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 你也快点 神父{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! There you go! Okay, you too. Come on, Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:19.67,2:30:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快低下头 爆炸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, heads down! This is it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:21.88,2:30:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是 - 不是 那是蝙蝠侠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - No, that's Batman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:13.02,2:31:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's detonation!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:21.78,2:31:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在海上 不在城市里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's out over the bay! Clear of the city!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:43.55,2:31:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我看见一座美丽的城市」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I see a beautiful city…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:46.55,2:31:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,「和一群杰出的民众」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and a brilliant people…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:48.93,2:31:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,「从这个深渊中升起」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…rising from this abyss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:52.14,2:31:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我看见我为之献出生命的人们」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see the lives for which I lay down my life…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:31:56.56,2:32:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,「过着和平 有益 繁荣和幸福的生活」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…peaceful, useful, prosperous and happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:04.24,2:32:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我看见我在他们的心中…」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see that I hold a sanctuary in their hearts…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:09.70,2:32:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,「和世世代代后裔的心中…」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and in the hearts of their descendants…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:13.70,2:32:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,「占有神圣的地位」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…generations hence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:18.12,2:32:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我现在所做的事」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a far, far better thing that I do…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:23.21,2:32:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,「远比我所做过的一切都美好」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…than I have ever done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:26.22,2:32:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我现在将获得的休息」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a far, far better rest that I go to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:33.64,2:32:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,「远比我所经历的一切都安详」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…than I have ever known."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:53.70,2:32:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:55.49,2:32:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让您失望了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I failed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:32:59.25,2:33:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,您这么信任我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trusted me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:02.46,2:33:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我却辜负了您{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and I failed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:07.72,2:33:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以改变心意吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I change your mind…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:11.84,2:33:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于辞职的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…about quitting the force?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:14.68,2:33:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得你曾跟我说过体制成为枷锁的事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what you said about structures becoming shackles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:18.89,2:33:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的很对 而我无法忍受这种不公不义{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right, and I can't take it. The injustice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:22.65,2:33:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们永远不会知道是谁拯救了这个城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, no one's ever gonna know who saved an entire city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:27.15,2:33:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,会知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:30.15,2:33:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是蝙蝠侠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the Batman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:49.92,2:33:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦恩先生的遗嘱没有依减少的资产而做修订{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Wayne's will was not amended to reflect his more modest estate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:53.68,2:33:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但仍有极为可观的财产可供处分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nonetheless, there are considerable assets to dispose of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:33:57.68,2:34:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,其宅邸内物品出售的所得将用来清偿债务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The contents of the house are to be sold to settle the estate's accounts…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:01.31,2:34:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,余额全数归于阿福·潘尼华斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the remainder is left in its entirety to Alfred J. Pennyworth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:07.11,2:34:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,房屋和土地遗赠给高谭市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The house and grounds are left to the city of Gotham on condition that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:12.15,2:34:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,条件是不得拆除、变更或行其他干涉之事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…they never be demolished, altered or otherwise interfered with…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:16.03,2:34:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且只能做为唯一指定用途使用：{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and that they shall be used for one purpose, and one purpose only:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:21.50,2:34:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,本市的受虐儿童及孤儿收容中心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The housing and care of the city's at-risk and orphaned children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:26.34,2:34:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的办事员会协助处理其他遗留书信和指示{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My clerk can help with the smaller correspondences and instructions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:30.97,2:34:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·布莱克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blake, John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:32.68,2:34:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有你的名字 - 那看看我的本名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing here. - Uh, try my legal name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:39.35,2:34:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该使用你的本名 这名字很好听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should use your full name. I like that name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:42.31,2:34:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗宾 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Robin. - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:44.35,2:34:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要继续在这软件上耗费心思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why worry about the stabilization software?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:46.69,2:34:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种自动驾驶系统很早就被淘汰了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This entire autopilot system's completely obsolete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:48.86,2:34:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想知道为什么我修不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, I just need to know what I could've done to fix it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:52.82,2:34:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 福克斯先生 明明六个月前已经修好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Mr. Fox, it's already been fixed. Software patch. Six months ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:34:57.12,2:34:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以查查是谁修好的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the ID on the patch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:01.79,2:35:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁斯·韦恩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bruce Wayne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:04.25,2:35:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找到缺漏物品了吗？ - 还没{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Any news on the missing item? - Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:35:06.71,2:35:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要想尽办法把它找出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They better leave no stone unturned.{\r}
